upe, ces Pokémon se réunissent et l’affrontent en émettant des ultrasons en chœur.",learn:[[15,"fury-swipes"],[22,"toxic-spikes"],[29,"double-kick"],[36,"bite"],[43,"helping-hand"],[50,"toxic"],[57,"flatter"],[64,"crunch"],[71,"earth-power"]]},{id:31,name:"Nidoqueen",key:"nidoqueen",types:["poison","ground"],stats:{hp:90,atk:92,def:87,spa:75,spd:85,spe:76},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:60,genus:"Pokémon Perceur",flavor:"Ce Pokémon calme les petits de son espèce en les plaçant entre ses épines dorsales. Dans ce cas, elles ne libèrent pas de poison.",learn:[[0,"superpower"]]},{id:32,name:"Nidoran♂",key:"nidoran-m",types:["poison"],stats:{hp:46,atk:57,def:40,spa:40,spd:40,spe:50},captureRate:235,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:9,genus:"Pokémon Vénépic",flavor:"Malgré sa petite taille, il est très téméraire. Afin de protéger sa compagne, il est prêt à se battre et à risquer sa vie.",learn:[[1,"poison-sting"],[1,"leer"],[5,"peck"],[10,"focus-energy"],[15,"fury-attack"],[20,"toxic-spikes"],[25,"double-kick"],[30,"horn-attack"],[35,"helping-hand"],[40,"toxic"],[45,"flatter"],[50,"poison-jab"],[55,"earth-power"]]},{id:33,name:"Nidorino",key:"nidorino",types:["poison"],stats:{hp:61,atk:72,def:57,spa:55,spd:55,spe:65},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:19.5,genus:"Pokémon Vénépic",flavor:"D’un naturel nerveux, il est prompt à se battre. Lorsqu’il a une montée d’adrénaline, la concentration de son poison augmente.",learn:[[15,"fury-attack"],[22,"toxic-spikes"],[29,"double-kick"],[36,"horn-attack"],[43,"helping-hand"],[50,"toxic"],[57,"flatter"],[64,"poison-jab"],[71,"earth-power"]]},{id:34,name:"Nidoking",key:"nidoking",types:["poison","ground"],stats:{hp:81,atk:102,def:77,spa:85,spd:75,spe:85},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:62,genus:"Pokémon Perceur",flavor:"Très fier de sa force, il se bat vigoureusement à l’aide de sa queue robuste et de sa corne capable de briser le diamant.",learn:[[0,"megahorn"]]},{id:35,name:"Mélofée",key:"clefairy",types:["fairy"],stats:{hp:70,atk:45,def:48,spa:60,spd:65,spe:35},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:7.5,genus:"Pokémon Fée",flavor:"Son comportement et son cri adorables font de lui un Pokémon très populaire. Malheureusement, il est difficile d’en croiser un spécimen.",learn:[[4,"stored-power"],[8,"encore"],[12,"after-you"],[16,"life-dew"],[20,"metronome"],[24,"moonlight"],[28,"gravity"],[32,"meteor-mash"],[36,"follow-me"],[40,"cosmic-power"],[44,"moonblast"],[48,"healing-wish"]]},{id:36,name:"Mélodelfe",key:"clefable",types:["fairy"],stats:{hp:95,atk:70,def:73,spa:95,spd:90,spe:60},captureRate:25,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:40,genus:"Pokémon Fée",flavor:"Capable d’entendre une aiguille tomber à plus d’un kilomètre, ce Pokémon préfère les endroits calmes et isolés.",learn:[]},{id:37,name:"Goupix",key:"vulpix",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:38,atk:41,def:40,spa:50,spd:65,spe:65},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:9.9,genus:"Pokémon Renard",flavor:"Avec l’âge, la fourrure de ses six queues devient de plus en plus belle et soyeuse. Elle est chaude au toucher.",learn:[[1,"tail-whip"],[1,"ember"],[4,"disable"],[8,"quick-attack"],[12,"spite"],[16,"incinerate"],[20,"confuse-ray"],[24,"will-o-wisp"],[28,"extrasensory"],[32,"flamethrower"],[36,"imprison"],[40,"fire-spin"],[44,"safeguard"],[48,"inferno"],[52,"fire-blast"]]},{id:38,name:"Feunard",key:"ninetales",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:73,atk:76,def:75,spa:81,spd:100,spe:100},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:19.9,genus:"Pokémon Renard",flavor:"Il est très intelligent et rancunier. Quiconque attrape une de ses queues se fera maudire pour 1 000 ans.",learn:[]},{id:39,name:"Rondoudou",key:"jigglypuff",types:["normal","fairy"],stats:{hp:115,atk:45,def:20,spa:45,spd:25,spe:20},captureRate:170,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:5.5,genus:"Pokémon Bouboule",flavor:"Il module librement la longueur d’onde de sa voix pour chanter une étrange mélodie qui endort à tous les coups celui qui l’écoute.",learn:[[4,"echoed-voice"],[8,"covet"],[12,"stockpile"],[12,"spit-up"],[12,"swallow"],[16,"round"],[20,"rest"],[24,"body-slam"],[28,"mimic"],[32,"gyro-ball"],[36,"hyper-voice"],[44,"double-edge"]]},{id:40,name:"Grodoudou",key:"wigglytuff",types:["normal","fairy"],stats:{hp:140,atk:70,def:45,spa:85,spd:50,spe:45},captureRate:50,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:12,genus:"Pokémon Bouboule",flavor:"Sa fourrure soyeuse fait sa fierté. La touffe sur son front est si douce que la caresser donne l’impression d’être sur un petit nuage.",learn:[[5,"play-rough"]]},{id:41,name:"Nosferapti",key:"zubat",types:["poison","flying"],stats:{hp:40,atk:45,def:35,spa:30,spd:40,spe:55},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:7.5,genus:"Pokémon Chovsouris",flavor:"Ils vivent dans les grottes où la lumière du jour ne perce jamais. Le matin, ils se blottissent les uns contre les autres pour se réchauffer et dormir.",learn:[[1,"supersonic"],[1,"absorb"],[5,"astonish"],[10,"mean-look"],[15,"poison-fang"],[20,"quick-guard"],[25,"air-cutter"],[30,"bite"],[35,"haze"],[40,"venoshock"],[45,"confuse-ray"],[50,"air-slash"],[55,"leech-life"]]},{id:42,name:"Nosferalto",key:"golbat",types:["poison","flying"],stats:{hp:75,atk:80,def:70,spa:65,spd:75,spe:90},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.6,weight:55,genus:"Pokémon Chovsouris",flavor:"Il se déplace habilement sur ses petites pattes, s’approche silencieusement de sa proie endormie, et lui suce le sang à l’aide de ses crocs.",learn:[[15,"poison-fang"],[20,"quick-guard"],[27,"air-cutter"],[34,"bite"],[41,"haze"],[48,"venoshock"],[55,"confuse-ray"],[62,"air-slash"],[69,"leech-life"]]},{id:43,name:"Mystherbe",key:"oddish",types:["grass","poison"],stats:{hp:45,atk:50,def:55,spa:75,spd:65,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:5.4,genus:"Pokémon Racine",flavor:"Pendant la journée, il reste en sous-sol et évite le soleil. Il grandit en se baignant au clair de lune.",learn:[[1,"absorb"],[1,"growth"],[4,"acid"],[8,"sweet-scent"],[12,"mega-drain"],[14,"poison-powder"],[16,"stun-spore"],[18,"sleep-powder"],[20,"giga-drain"],[24,"toxic"],[28,"moonblast"],[32,"grassy-terrain"],[36,"moonlight"],[40,"petal-dance"]]},{id:44,name:"Ortide",key:"gloom",types:["grass","poison"],stats:{hp:60,atk:65,def:70,spa:85,spd:75,spe:40},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:8.6,genus:"Pokémon Racine",flavor:"Ce qui semble être sa bave est en fait du nectar très collant. Si on le touche, il est très difficile de s’en dépêtrer.",learn:[[12,"mega-drain"],[14,"poison-powder"],[16,"stun-spore"],[18,"sleep-powder"],[20,"giga-drain"],[26,"toxic"],[32,"moonblast"],[38,"grassy-terrain"],[44,"moonlight"],[50,"petal-dance"]]},{id:45,name:"Rafflesia",key:"vileplume",types:["grass","poison"],stats:{hp:75,atk:80,def:85,spa:110,spd:90,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:18.6,genus:"Pokémon Fleur",flavor:"Plus ses pétales sont grands, plus il produit de pollen toxique. Toutefois, le poids de sa tête le fatigue.",learn:[[0,"petal-blizzard"]]},{id:46,name:"Paras",key:"paras",types:["bug","grass"],stats:{hp:35,atk:70,def:55,spa:45,spd:55,spe:25},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:5.4,genus:"Pokémon Champignon",flavor:"Il s’enfouit pour ronger des racines, mais ce sont les champignons sur son dos qui absorbent presque tous les nutriments.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[6,"poison-powder"],[6,"stun-spore"],[11,"absorb"],[17,"fury-cutter"],[22,"spore"],[27,"slash"],[33,"growth"],[38,"giga-drain"],[43,"aromatherapy"],[49,"rage-powder"],[54,"x-scissor"]]},{id:47,name:"Parasect",key:"parasect",types:["bug","grass"],stats:{hp:60,atk:95,def:80,spa:60,spd:80,spe:30},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:29.5,genus:"Pokémon Champignon",flavor:"À force de voir son énergie aspirée, il semblerait que ce ne soit plus l’insecte qui réfléchisse, mais le champignon sur son dos.",learn:[[17,"fury-cutter"],[22,"spore"],[29,"slash"],[37,"growth"],[44,"giga-drain"],[51,"aromatherapy"],[59,"rage-powder"],[66,"x-scissor"]]},{id:48,name:"Mimitoss",key:"venonat",types:["bug","poison"],stats:{hp:60,atk:55,def:50,spa:40,spd:55,spe:45},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:30,genus:"Pokémon Vermine",flavor:"Ses grands yeux lui servent de radar. En pleine lumière, on peut y distinguer des facettes.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"disable"],[5,"supersonic"],[11,"confusion"],[13,"poison-powder"],[17,"psybeam"],[23,"stun-spore"],[25,"bug-buzz"],[29,"sleep-powder"],[35,"leech-life"],[37,"zen-headbutt"],[41,"poison-fang"],[47,"psychic"]]},{id:49,name:"Aéromite",key:"venomoth",types:["bug","poison"],stats:{hp:70,atk:65,def:60,spa:90,spd:75,spe:90},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:12.5,genus:"Pokémon Papipoison",flavor:"Les écailles de ses ailes sont presque impossibles à retirer lorsqu’elles se collent à la peau, et elles libèrent un poison violent au contact.",learn:[[0,"air-slash"],[11,"confusion"],[13,"poison-powder"],[17,"psybeam"],[23,"stun-spore"],[25,"bug-buzz"],[29,"sleep-powder"],[37,"leech-life"],[41,"zen-headbutt"],[47,"poison-fang"],[55,"psychic"]]},{id:50,name:"Taupiqueur",key:"diglett",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:10,atk:55,def:25,spa:35,spd:45,spe:95},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.2,weight:.8,genus:"Pokémon Taupe",flavor:"Ce Pokémon creuse sous terre à faible profondeur. La terre qu’il laisse dans son sillage le rend facile à repérer.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"sand-attack"],[4,"growl"],[8,"astonish"],[12,"mud-slap"],[16,"bulldoze"],[20,"sucker-punch"],[24,"slash"],[28,"sandstorm"],[32,"dig"],[36,"earth-power"],[40,"earthquake"],[44,"fissure"]]},{id:51,name:"Triopikeur",key:"dugtrio",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:35,atk:100,def:50,spa:50,spd:70,spe:120},captureRate:50,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:33.3,genus:"Pokémon Taupe",flavor:"Ce trio de Taupiqueur est capable de creuser jusqu’à 100 km sous terre, vers l’inconnu.",learn:[[0,"sand-tomb"],[12,"mud-slap"],[16,"bulldoze"],[20,"sucker-punch"],[24,"slash"],[30,"sandstorm"],[36,"dig"],[42,"earth-power"],[48,"earthquake"],[54,"fissure"]]},{id:52,name:"Miaouss",key:"meowth",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:40,atk:45,def:35,spa:40,spd:40,spe:90},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:4.2,genus:"Pokémon Chadégout",flavor:"Tatillon sur la propreté de la pièce sur son front, il se lave la figure avec grand soin. Il ne s’entend pas avec les Miaouss de Galar.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"fake-out"],[4,"feint"],[8,"scratch"],[12,"pay-day"],[16,"bite"],[20,"taunt"],[24,"assurance"],[29,"fury-swipes"],[32,"screech"],[36,"slash"],[40,"nasty-plot"],[44,"play-rough"]]},{id:53,name:"Persian",key:"persian",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:65,atk:70,def:60,spa:65,spd:65,spe:115},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:32,genus:"Pokémon Chadeville",flavor:"Il se comporte avec grâce et élégance, et ne s’entend pas avec les rustres Berserkatt : les deux espèces se méprisent.",learn:[[0,"power-gem"],[12,"pay-day"],[16,"bite"],[20,"taunt"],[24,"assurance"],[31,"fury-swipes"],[36,"screech"],[42,"slash"],[48,"nasty-plot"],[54,"play-rough"]]},{id:54,name:"Psykokwak",key:"psyduck",types:["water"],stats:{hp:50,atk:52,def:48,spa:65,spd:50,spe:55},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:19.6,genus:"Pokémon Canard",flavor:"Sa migraine s’intensifie à mesure que son stress monte. Il libère une force psychique puissante qui terrasse tous ceux qui l’entourent.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"tail-whip"],[3,"water-gun"],[6,"confusion"],[9,"fury-swipes"],[12,"water-pulse"],[15,"disable"],[18,"zen-headbutt"],[21,"screech"],[24,"aqua-tail"],[27,"soak"],[30,"psych-up"],[34,"amnesia"],[39,"wonder-room"]]},{id:55,name:"Akwakwak",key:"golduck",types:["water"],stats:{hp:80,atk:82,def:78,spa:95,spd:80,spe:85},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.7,weight:76.6,genus:"Pokémon Canard",flavor:"D’après de vieilles légendes, ce Pokémon entraînait au fond de l’eau tous ceux qui osaient souiller sa rivière.",learn:[[9,"fury-swipes"],[12,"water-pulse"],[15,"disable"],[18,"zen-headbutt"],[21,"screech"],[24,"aqua-tail"],[27,"soak"],[30,"psych-up"],[36,"amnesia"],[40,"hydro-pump"],[45,"wonder-room"]]},{id:56,name:"Férosinge",key:"mankey",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:40,atk:80,def:35,spa:35,spd:45,spe:70},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:28,genus:"Pokémon Porsinge",flavor:"Agile et rapide, ce Pokémon vit dans les arbres. Il s’énerve facilement et s’attaque à tout ce qui bouge quand il est en colère.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"leer"],[1,"focus-energy"],[1,"covet"],[5,"fury-swipes"],[8,"low-kick"],[12,"seismic-toss"],[17,"swagger"],[22,"cross-chop"],[26,"assurance"],[29,"thrash"],[33,"close-combat"],[36,"screech"],[40,"stomping-tantrum"],[44,"outrage"],[48,"final-gambit"]]},{id:57,name:"Colossinge",key:"primeape",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:65,atk:105,def:60,spa:60,spd:70,spe:95},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:32,genus:"Pokémon Porsinge",flavor:"Sa fureur prend fin quand il n’a plus personne à frapper. Il est difficile d’en être témoin.",learn:[[5,"fury-swipes"],[8,"low-kick"],[15,"seismic-toss"],[17,"swagger"],[22,"cross-chop"],[26,"assurance"],[30,"thrash"],[35,"rage-fist"],[39,"close-combat"],[44,"screech"],[48,"stomping-tantrum"],[53,"outrage"],[57,"final-gambit"]]},{id:58,name:"Caninos",key:"growlithe",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:55,atk:70,def:45,spa:70,spd:50,spe:60},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:19,genus:"Pokémon Chiot",flavor:"Très fidèle, il aboie de toutes ses forces pour protéger son Dresseur d’Origine quand un danger le guette.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"ember"],[4,"howl"],[8,"bite"],[12,"flame-wheel"],[16,"helping-hand"],[20,"agility"],[24,"fire-fang"],[28,"retaliate"],[32,"crunch"],[36,"take-down"],[40,"flamethrower"],[44,"roar"],[48,"play-rough"],[52,"reversal"],[56,"flare-blitz"]]},{id:59,name:"Arcanin",key:"arcanine",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:90,atk:110,def:80,spa:100,spd:80,spe:95},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.9,weight:155,genus:"Pokémon Légendaire",flavor:"Ce Pokémon est admiré depuis toujours pour sa beauté. Il court avec tellement de légèreté qu’on dirait qu’il vole.",learn:[[0,"extreme-speed"],[5,"flamethrower"]]},{id:60,name:"Ptitard",key:"poliwag",types:["water"],stats:{hp:40,atk:50,def:40,spa:40,spd:40,spe:90},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:12.4,genus:"Pokémon Têtard",flavor:"Dans les rivières au courant puissant, il se sert de ses lèvres épaisses comme d’une ventouse pour s’accrocher aux rochers.",learn:[[1,"water-gun"],[1,"hypnosis"],[6,"pound"],[12,"mud-shot"],[18,"bubble-beam"],[24,"rain-dance"],[30,"body-slam"],[36,"earth-power"],[42,"hydro-pump"],[48,"belly-drum"],[54,"double-edge"]]},{id:61,name:"Têtarte",key:"poliwhirl",types:["water"],stats:{hp:65,atk:65,def:65,spa:50,spd:50,spe:90},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:20,genus:"Pokémon Têtard",flavor:"Il sécrète une sorte de mucus huileux qui lui permet d’échapper aux ennemis qui tentent de l’attraper.",learn:[[18,"bubble-beam"],[24,"rain-dance"],[32,"body-slam"],[40,"earth-power"],[48,"hydro-pump"],[56,"belly-drum"],[66,"double-edge"]]},{id:62,name:"Tartard",key:"poliwrath",types:["water","fighting"],stats:{hp:90,atk:95,def:95,spa:70,spd:90,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:54,genus:"Pokémon Têtard",flavor:"Aussi habile à la nage qu’au combat, il peut donner de vigoureux coups de poing avec ses bras musclés.",learn:[[0,"dynamic-punch"]]},{id:63,name:"Abra",key:"abra",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:25,atk:20,def:15,spa:105,spd:55,spe:90},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:19.5,genus:"Pokémon Psy",flavor:"Il peut se téléporter en dormant. On dit que plus son sommeil est profond, plus il se téléporte loin.",learn:[[1,"teleport"]]},{id:64,name:"Kadabra",key:"kadabra",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:40,atk:35,def:30,spa:120,spd:70,spe:105},captureRate:100,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:56.5,genus:"Pokémon Psy",flavor:"Incroyablement doué en télékinésie, il concentre son énergie psychique dans l’étoile sur son front en prévision de son évolution.",learn:[[0,"confusion"],[5,"psybeam"],[10,"reflect"],[15,"ally-switch"],[20,"psycho-cut"],[25,"recover"],[30,"psyshock"],[35,"psychic"],[40,"role-play"],[45,"future-sight"],[50,"calm-mind"]]},{id:65,name:"Alakazam",key:"alakazam",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:55,atk:50,def:45,spa:135,spd:95,spe:120},captureRate:50,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:48,genus:"Pokémon Psy",flavor:"Il dispose d’immenses pouvoirs psychiques. On raconte qu’il s’en est servi afin de créer les cuillères qu’il tient dans chaque main.",learn:[[5,"psybeam"],[10,"reflect"],[15,"ally-switch"],[20,"psycho-cut"],[25,"recover"],[30,"psyshock"],[35,"psychic"],[40,"role-play"],[45,"future-sight"],[50,"calm-mind"]]},{id:66,name:"Machoc",key:"machop",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:70,atk:80,def:50,spa:35,spd:35,spe:35},captureRate:180,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:19.5,genus:"Pokémon Colosse",flavor:"Il essaie de dépenser son énergie débordante en soulevant des rochers, ce qui le rend encore plus fort.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"low-kick"],[4,"focus-energy"],[8,"revenge"],[12,"low-sweep"],[16,"knock-off"],[20,"scary-face"],[24,"vital-throw"],[29,"strength"],[32,"dual-chop"],[36,"bulk-up"],[40,"seismic-toss"],[44,"dynamic-punch"],[48,"cross-chop"],[52,"double-edge"]]},{id:67,name:"Machopeur",key:"machoke",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:80,atk:100,def:70,spa:50,spd:60,spe:45},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:70.5,genus:"Pokémon Colosse",flavor:"Son corps robuste ne se fatigue jamais. Il n’hésite pas à aider les gens lorsqu’il s’agit de soulever des objets très lourds.",learn:[[12,"low-sweep"],[16,"knock-off"],[20,"scary-face"],[24,"vital-