"],stats:{hp:250,atk:5,def:5,spa:35,spd:105,spe:50},captureRate:30,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:34.6,genus:"Pokémon Œuf",flavor:"Ce Pokémon lent à l’origine a appris à fuir plus vite pour protéger ses œufs des voleurs.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"defense-curl"],[1,"sweet-kiss"],[1,"charm"],[1,"covet"],[1,"copycat"],[1,"disarming-voice"],[4,"tail-whip"],[8,"echoed-voice"],[12,"life-dew"],[16,"sing"],[20,"fling"],[24,"take-down"],[28,"heal-pulse"],[32,"helping-hand"],[36,"light-screen"],[40,"double-edge"],[44,"soft-boiled"],[48,"last-resort"],[52,"healing-wish"]]},{id:114,name:"Saquedeneu",key:"tangela",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:65,atk:55,def:115,spa:100,spd:40,spe:60},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:35,genus:"Pokémon Vigne",flavor:"Ses lianes ont une odeur particulière. Elles servent d’herbes aromatiques dans une certaine zone de Galar.",learn:[[1,"bind"],[1,"absorb"],[4,"stun-spore"],[8,"growth"],[12,"mega-drain"],[16,"vine-whip"],[20,"poison-powder"],[24,"ancient-power"],[28,"knock-off"],[32,"giga-drain"],[36,"sleep-powder"],[40,"slam"],[44,"tickle"],[48,"power-whip"],[52,"ingrain"],[56,"grassy-terrain"]]},{id:115,name:"Kangourex",key:"kangaskhan",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:105,atk:95,def:80,spa:40,spd:80,spe:90},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.2,weight:80,genus:"Pokémon Maternel",flavor:"Certains documents certifient que les Kangourex sans progéniture élevaient des enfants humains en détresse.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"tail-whip"],[4,"growl"],[8,"fake-out"],[12,"bite"],[16,"stomp"],[20,"focus-energy"],[24,"headbutt"],[28,"sucker-punch"],[32,"double-hit"],[36,"crunch"],[40,"endure"],[44,"reversal"],[48,"outrage"],[52,"last-resort"]]},{id:116,name:"Hypotrempe",key:"horsea",types:["water"],stats:{hp:30,atk:40,def:70,spa:70,spd:25,spe:60},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:8,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"Hypotrempe crée des tourbillons en dansant sous l’eau. Il s’amuse à comparer la taille des remous qu’il fait avec ceux de ses congénères.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"water-gun"],[5,"smokescreen"],[10,"twister"],[15,"focus-energy"],[20,"dragon-breath"],[25,"bubble-beam"],[30,"agility"],[35,"water-pulse"],[40,"dragon-pulse"],[45,"hydro-pump"],[50,"dragon-dance"],[55,"rain-dance"]]},{id:117,name:"Hypocéan",key:"seadra",types:["water"],stats:{hp:55,atk:65,def:95,spa:95,spd:45,spe:85},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:25,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"Sa puissance de succion est si forte qu’il peut aspirer en un instant ses proies pour les manger, même si elles sont plus grosses que sa bouche.",learn:[[15,"focus-energy"],[20,"dragon-breath"],[25,"bubble-beam"],[30,"agility"],[37,"water-pulse"],[44,"dragon-pulse"],[51,"hydro-pump"],[58,"dragon-dance"],[65,"rain-dance"]]},{id:118,name:"Poissirène",key:"goldeen",types:["water"],stats:{hp:45,atk:67,def:60,spa:35,spd:50,spe:63},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:15,genus:"Pokémon Poisson",flavor:"Ses nageoires dorsales et pectorales sont très développées. Elles lui permettent de nager à une vitesse de cinq nœuds.",learn:[[1,"tail-whip"],[1,"peck"],[5,"supersonic"],[10,"water-pulse"],[15,"horn-attack"],[20,"agility"],[25,"aqua-ring"],[30,"flail"],[35,"waterfall"],[40,"soak"],[45,"megahorn"],[50,"horn-drill"]]},{id:119,name:"Poissoroy",key:"seaking",types:["water"],stats:{hp:80,atk:92,def:65,spa:65,spd:80,spe:68},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:39,genus:"Pokémon Poisson",flavor:"S’il fait des trous dans les rochers avec sa corne pour bâtir son nid, c’est pour éviter que ses Œufs ne soient emportés par les flots.",learn:[[15,"horn-attack"],[20,"agility"],[25,"aqua-ring"],[30,"flail"],[37,"waterfall"],[44,"soak"],[51,"megahorn"],[58,"horn-drill"]]},{id:120,name:"Stari",key:"staryu",types:["water"],stats:{hp:30,atk:45,def:55,spa:70,spd:55,spe:85},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:34.5,genus:"Pokémon Étoile",flavor:"Il ne se soucie guère des Pokémon poissons qui viennent le grignoter, car même si son corps est déchiqueté, il se régénère aussitôt.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"harden"],[4,"water-gun"],[8,"confuse-ray"],[12,"rapid-spin"],[16,"minimize"],[20,"swift"],[24,"psybeam"],[28,"brine"],[32,"light-screen"],[36,"power-gem"],[40,"psychic"],[44,"surf"],[48,"recover"],[52,"cosmic-power"],[56,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:121,name:"Staross",key:"starmie",types:["water","psychic"],stats:{hp:60,atk:75,def:85,spa:100,spd:85,spe:115},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:80,genus:"Pokémon Mystérieux",flavor:"Il aspire du plancton quand il nage dans la mer en faisant tourner son corps à grande vitesse.",learn:[]},{id:122,name:"M. Mime",key:"mr-mime",types:["psychic","fairy"],stats:{hp:40,atk:45,def:65,spa:100,spd:120,spe:90},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:54.5,genus:"Pokémon Bloqueur",flavor:"Son talent pour le mime est indéniable. Il émet des ondes du bout des doigts pour créer un mur qui le protège de nombreuses attaques.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"baton-pass"],[1,"encore"],[1,"copycat"],[1,"power-swap"],[1,"guard-swap"],[1,"wide-guard"],[1,"quick-guard"],[12,"confusion"],[16,"role-play"],[20,"protect"],[24,"recycle"],[28,"psybeam"],[32,"mimic"],[36,"light-screen"],[36,"reflect"],[36,"safeguard"],[40,"sucker-punch"],[44,"dazzling-gleam"],[48,"psychic"],[52,"teeter-dance"]]},{id:123,name:"Insécateur",key:"scyther",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:70,atk:110,def:80,spa:55,spd:80,spe:105},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:56,genus:"Pokémon Mante",flavor:"Si l’on voit un grand nombre d’arbres abattus au même endroit dans une forêt, cela signifie que l’on se trouve sur le territoire d’un Insécateur.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"quick-attack"],[4,"fury-cutter"],[8,"false-swipe"],[12,"wing-attack"],[16,"double-team"],[20,"double-hit"],[24,"slash"],[28,"focus-energy"],[32,"agility"],[36,"air-slash"],[40,"x-scissor"],[44,"swords-dance"]]},{id:124,name:"Lippou