émon Flamme",flavor:"On raconte qu’il a sauvé des personnes perdues en montagne en illuminant les sentiers à l’aide de ses splendides ailes flamboyantes.",learn:[[1,"gust"],[1,"leer"],[5,"ember"],[10,"safeguard"],[15,"wing-attack"],[20,"agility"],[25,"ancient-power"],[30,"incinerate"],[35,"air-slash"],[40,"roost"],[45,"heat-wave"],[50,"sunny-day"],[55,"hurricane"],[60,"endure"],[65,"overheat"],[70,"sky-attack"]]},{id:147,name:"Minidraco",key:"dratini",types:["dragon"],stats:{hp:41,atk:64,def:45,spa:50,spd:50,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:3.3,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"On a longtemps douté de l’existence de ce Pokémon. La petite bosse sur son front est en fait sa corne en pleine croissance.",learn:[[1,"wrap"],[1,"leer"],[5,"twister"],[10,"thunder-wave"],[15,"dragon-tail"],[20,"agility"],[25,"slam"],[31,"aqua-tail"],[35,"dragon-rush"],[40,"safeguard"],[45,"rain-dance"],[50,"dragon-dance"],[55,"outrage"],[60,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:148,name:"Draco",key:"dragonair",types:["dragon"],stats:{hp:61,atk:84,def:65,spa:70,spd:70,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:4,weight:16.5,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"Il contrôle la météo en accumulant de l’énergie dans les orbes au bout de sa queue. Sa silhouette nimbée d’une aura lui confère un air mystique.",learn:[[15,"dragon-tail"],[20,"agility"],[25,"slam"],[33,"aqua-tail"],[39,"dragon-rush"],[46,"safeguard"],[53,"rain-dance"],[60,"dragon-dance"],[67,"outrage"],[74,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:149,name:"Dracolosse",key:"dragonite",types:["dragon","flying"],stats:{hp:91,atk:134,def:95,spa:100,spd:100,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.2,weight:210,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"On l’appelle « l’avatar de la mer ». Nombreux sont les navires arborant une figure de proue en forme de Dracolosse.",learn:[[0,"hurricane"],[15,"dragon-tail"],[20,"agility"],[25,"slam"],[33,"aqua-tail"],[39,"dragon-rush"],[41,"outrage"],[46,"safeguard"],[53,"rain-dance"],[62,"dragon-dance"],[80,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:150,name:"Mewtwo",key:"mewtwo",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:106,atk:110,def:90,spa:154,spd:90,spe:130},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:122,genus:"Pokémon Génétique",flavor:"Son ADN est presque le même que celui de Mew, mais sa taille et son caractère sont très différents.",learn:[[1,"disable"],[1,"confusion"],[1,"swift"],[1,"life-dew"],[8,"ancient-power"],[16,"psycho-cut"],[24,"safeguard"],[32,"amnesia"],[40,"aura-sphere"],[48,"psychic"],[56,"power-swap"],[56,"guard-swap"],[64,"mist"],[72,"psystrike"],[80,"recover"],[88,"future-sight"]]},{id:151,name:"Mew",key:"mew",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:100,atk:100,def:100,spa:100,spd:100,spe:100},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!0,height:.4,weight:4,genus:"Pokémon Nouveau",flavor:"À l’aide d’un microscope, on peut distinguer le pelage extrêmement court, fin et délicat de ce Pokémon.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"reflect-type"],[10,"amnesia"],[20,"baton-pass"],[30,"ancient-power"],[40,"life-dew"],[50,"nasty-plot"],[60,"metronome"],[70,"imprison"],[80,"transform"],[90,"aura-sphere"],[100,"psychic"]]},{id:152,name:"Germignon",key:"chikorita",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:45,atk:49,def:65,spa:49,spd:65,spe:45},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:6.4,genus:"Pokémon Feuille",flavor:"Lorsqu’il se bat, Germignon secoue sa feuille pour tenir son ennemi à distance. Un doux parfum s’en dégage également, apaisant les Pokémon qui se battent et créant une atmosphère agréable et amicale.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"growl"],[6,"razor-leaf"],[9,"poison-powder"],[12,"synthesis"],[17,"reflect"],[20,"magical-leaf"],[23,"leech-seed"],[28,"sweet-scent"],[31,"light-screen"],[34,"body-slam"],[39,"safeguard"],[42,"giga-drain"],[45,"solar-beam"]]},{id:153,name:"Macronium",key:"bayleef",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:60,atk:62,def:80,spa:63,spd:80,spe:60},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:15.8,genus:"Pokémon Feuille",flavor:"Le cou de Macronium est entouré de nombreuses feuilles. Dans chacune d’elles se trouve une pousse d’arbre. Le parfum de cette pousse donne la pêche aux personnes qui le sentent.",learn:[[12,"synthesis"],[18,"reflect"],[22,"magical-leaf"],[26,"leech-seed"],[32,"sweet-scent"],[36,"light-screen"],[40,"body-slam"],[46,"safeguard"],[50,"giga-drain"],[54,"solar-beam"]]},{id:154,name:"Méganium",key:"meganium",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:80,atk:82,def:100,spa:83,spd:100,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:100.5,genus:"Pokémon Herbe",flavor:"Le parfum de la fleur de Méganium apaise et calme les esprits. Pendant les combats, ce Pokémon émet son parfum relaxant pour atténuer l’agressivité de l’ennemi.",learn:[[0,"petal-dance"],[12,"synthesis"],[18,"reflect"],[22,"magical-leaf"],[26,"leech-seed"],[34,"sweet-scent"],[40,"light-screen"],[46,"body-slam"],[54,"safeguard"],[60,"giga-drain"],[65,"solar-beam"]]},{id:155,name:"Héricendre",key:"cyndaquil",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:39,atk:52,def:43,spa:60,spd:50,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:7.9,genus:"Pokémon Souris Feu",flavor:"Héricendre se protège en faisant jaillir des flammes de son dos. Ces flammes peuvent être violentes si le Pokémon est en colère. Cependant, s’il est fatigué, seules quelques flammèches vacillent laborieusement.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"leer"],[6,"smokescreen"],[10,"ember"],[13,"quick-attack"],[19,"flame-wheel"],[22,"defense-curl"],[28,"flame-charge"],[31,"swift"],[37,"lava-plume"],[40,"flamethrower"],[46,"inferno"],[49,"rollout"],[55,"double-edge"],[58,"overheat"],[64,"eruption"]]},{id:156,name:"Feurisson",key:"quilava",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:58,atk:64,def:58,spa:80,spd:65,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:19,genus:"Pokémon Volcan",flavor:"Feurisson garde ses ennemis à distance grâce à l’intensité de ses flammes et à des rafales d’air brûlant. Ce Pokémon utilise son incroyable agilité pour éviter les attaques, tout en enflammant ses ennemis.",learn:[[10,"ember"],[13,"quick-attack"],[20,"flame-wheel"],[24,"defense-curl"],[31,"swift"],[35,"flame-charge"],[42,"lava-plume"],[46,"flamethrower"],[53,"inferno"],[57,"rollout"],[64,"double-edge"],[68,"overheat"],[75,"eruption"]]},{id:157,name:"Typhlosion",key:"typhlosion",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:78,atk:84,def:78,spa:109,spd:85,spe:100},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.7,weight:79.5,genus:"Pokémon Volcan",flavor:"Typhlosion se cache derrière un chatoyant nuage de chaleur qu’il crée en attisant ses flammes intenses. Ce Pokémon peut générer des rafales explosives qui réduisent tout en cendres.",learn:[[13,"quick-attack"],[20,"flame-wheel"],[24,"defense-curl"],[31,"swift"],[35,"flame-charge"],[43,"lava-plume"],[48,"flamethrower"],[56,"inferno"],[61,"rollout"],[74,"overheat"]]},{id:158,name:"Kaiminus",key:"totodile",types:["water"],stats:{hp:50,atk:65,def:64,spa:44,spd:48,spe:43},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:9.5,genus:"Pokémon Mâchoire",flavor:"Malgré son tout petit corps, la mâchoire de Kaiminus est très puissante. Parfois, ce Pokémon mordille les gens pour jouer, sans se rendre compte que sa morsure peut gravement blesser quelqu’un.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"leer"],[6,"water-gun"],[9,"bite"],[13,"scary-face"],[19,"ice-fang"],[22,"flail"],[27,"crunch"],[30,"slash"],[33,"screech"],[37,"thrash"],[41,"aqua-tail"],[45,"superpower"],[50,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:159,name:"Crocrodil",key:"croconaw",types:["water"],stats:{hp:65,atk:80,def:80,spa:59,spd:63,spe:58},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:25,genus:"Pokémon Mâchoire",flavor:"Une fois que Crocrodil a refermé sa mâchoire sur son ennemi, il est impossible de le faire lâcher prise. Ses crocs sont recourbés comme des hameçons et ne peuvent pas être retirés une fois enfoncés.",learn:[[13,"bite"],[15,"scary-face"],[21,"ice-fang"],[24,"flail"],[30,"crunch"],[34,"slash"],[37,"screech"],[42,"thrash"],[47,"aqua-tail"],[50,"superpower"],[55,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:160,name:"Aligatueur",key:"feraligatr",types:["water"],stats:{hp:85,atk:105,def:100,spa:79,spd:83,spe:78},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.3,weight:88.8,genus:"Pokémon Mâchoire",flavor:"Aligatueur impressionne ses ennemis en ouvrant son énorme gueule. Pendant les combats, il piétine le sol de ses puissantes pattes arrière avant de charger ses adversaires à pleine vitesse.",learn:[[13,"bite"],[15,"scary-face"],[21,"ice-fang"],[24,"flail"],[32,"crunch"],[37,"slash"],[44,"screech"],[51,"thrash"],[59,"aqua-tail"],[65,"superpower"],[70,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:161,name:"Fouinette",key:"sentret",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:35,atk:46,def:34,spa:35,spd:45,spe:20},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:6,genus:"Pokémon Espion",flavor:"Lorsqu’un Fouinette dort, un autre monte la garde. La sentinelle réveille les autres au moindre signe de danger. Si un de ces Pokémon est séparé de sa meute, il est incapable de dormir, car il a peur.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[4,"defense-curl"],[7,"quick-attack"],[13,"fury-swipes"],[16,"helping-hand"],[19,"follow-me"],[25,"slam"],[28,"rest"],[31,"sucker-punch"],[36,"amnesia"],[39,"baton-pass"],[42,"double-edge"],[47,"hyper-voice"]]},{id:162,name:"Fouinar",key:"furret",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:85,atk:76,def:64,spa:45,spd:55,spe:90},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:32.5,genus:"Pokémon Allongé",flavor:"Fouinar est très mince. Lorsqu’il est attaqué, il peut s’enfuir en se faufilant habilement dans les recoins étroits. Malgré ses pattes courtes, ce Pokémon est très agile et rapide.",learn:[[0,"agility"],[13,"fury-swipes"],[17,"helping-hand"],[21,"follow-me"],[28,"slam"],[32,"rest"],[36,"sucker-punch"],[42,"amnesia"],[46,"baton-pass"],[50,"double-edge"],[56,"hyper-voice"]]},{id:163,name:"Hoothoot",key:"hoothoot",types:["normal","flying"],stats:{hp:60,atk:30,def:30,spa:36,spd:56,spe:50},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:21.2,genus:"Pokémon Hibou",flavor:"Il hulule chaque jour aux mêmes moments. Certains Dresseurs s’en servent comme d’une montre.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"peck"],[3,"tackle"],[6,"echoed-voice"],[9,"confusion"],[12,"reflect"],[15,"defog"],[18,"air-slash"],[21,"extrasensory"],[24,"take-down"],[27,"uproar"],[30,"roost"],[33,"moonblast"],[36,"hypnosis"],[39,"dream-eater"]]},{id:164,name:"Noarfang",key:"noctowl",types:["normal","flying"],stats:{hp:100,atk:50,def:50,spa:86,spd:96,spe:70},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.6,weight:40.8,genus:"Pokémon Hibou",flavor:"Quand il réfléchit, il tourne sa tête sur 180 degrés pour optimiser son mode de pensée.",learn:[[9,"confusion"],[12,"reflect"],[18,"air-slash"],[23,"extrasensory"],[28,"take-down"],[33,"uproar"],[38,"roost"],[43,"moonblast"],[48,"hypnosis"],[53,"dream-eater"]]},{id:165,name:"Coxy",key:"ledyba",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:40,atk:20,def:30,spa:40,spd:80,spe:55},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:10.8,genus:"Pokémon 5 Étoiles",flavor:"Extrêmement timide, ce Pokémon défend le nid qu’il partage avec ses congénères en utilisant Protection.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[5,"supersonic"],[8,"swift"],[12,"light-screen"],[12,"reflect"],[12,"safeguard"],[15,"mach-punch"],[19,"roost"],[22,"struggle-bug"],[26,"baton-pass"],[29,"agility"],[33,"bug-buzz"],[36,"air-slash"],[40,"double-edge"]]},{id:166,name:"Coxyclaque",key:"ledian",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:55,atk:35,def:50,spa:55,spd:110,spe:85},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:35.6,genus:"Pokémon 5 Étoiles",flavor:"Il vole dans le ciel nocturne en répandant une poudre scintillante. Si elle vous touche, quelque chose de positif devrait bientôt vous arriver.",learn:[[12,"light-screen"],[12,"reflect"],[12,"safeguard"],[15,"mach-punch"],[20,"roost"],[24,"struggle-bug"],[29,"baton-pass"],[33,"agility"],[38,"bug-buzz"],[42,"air-slash"],[47,"double-edge"]]},{id:167,name:"Mimigal",key:"spinarak",types:["bug","poison"],stats:{hp:40,atk:60,def:40,spa:40,spd:40,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:8.5,genus:"Pokémon Crache Fil",flavor:"Le poison contenu dans les mandibules de ce Pokémon n’est pas très violent, mais il suffit à immobiliser les proies piégées dans sa toile.",learn:[[1,"poison-sting"],[1,"string-shot"],[5,"absorb"],[8,"infestation"],[12,"scary-face"],[15,"night-shade"],[19,"shadow-sneak"],[22,"fury-swipes"],[26,"sucker-punch"],[29,"agility"],[33,"pin-missile"],[36,"psychic"],[40,"poison-jab"],[44,"cross-poison"],[47,"sticky-web"],[51,"toxic-thread"]]},{id:168,name:"Migalos",key:"ariados",types:["bug","poison"],stats:{hp:70,atk:90,def:70,spa:60,spd:70,spe:40},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:33.5,genus:"Pokémon Long-Patte",flavor:"Il capture ses proies en projetant un fil qu’il sécrète. À la nuit tombée, il quitte sa toile et part chasser activement.",learn:[[0,"swords-dance"],[8,"infestation"],[12,"scary-face"],[15,"night-shade"],[19,"shadow-sneak"],[23,"fury-swipes"],[28,"sucker-punch"],[31,"agility"],[35,"pin-missile"],[41,"psychic"],[46,"poison-jab"],[50,"cross-poison"],[54,"sticky-web"],[59,"toxic-thread"]]},{id:169,name:"Nostenfer",key:"crobat",types:["poison","flying"],stats:{hp:85,atk:90,def:80,spa:70,spd:80,spe:130},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:75,genus:"Pokémon Chovsouris",flavor:"Il vole en contrôlant librement ses quatre ailes et peut se déplacer sans avoir besoin de ralentir, même dans les grottes étroites.",learn:[[0,"cross-poison"],[15,"poison-fang"],[20,"quick-guard"],[27,"air-cutter"],[34,"bite"],[41,"haze"],[48,"venoshock"],[55,"confuse-ray"],[62,"air-slash"],[69,"leech-life"]]},{id:170,name:"Loupio",key:"chinchou",types:["water","electric"],stats:{hp:75,atk:38,def:38,spa:56,spd:56,spe:67},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:12,genus:"Pokémon Poisson",flavor:"Au plus profond de l’océan, son seul moyen de communication est la lumière de ses antennes, qui clignotent constamment.",learn:[[1,"supersonic"],[1,"water-gun"],[4,"electro-ball"],[8,"thunder-wave"],[12,"bubble-beam"],[16,"confuse-ray"],[20,"spark"],[24,"charge"],[28,"discharge"],[32,"aqua-ring"],[36,"flail"],[40,"take-down"],[44,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:171,name:"Lanturn",key:"lanturn",types:["water","electric"],stats:{hp:125,atk:58,def:58,spa:76,spd:76,spe:67},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:22.5,genus:"Pokémon Lumière",flavor:"Il dégage une vive lumière pour éblouir ses proies, puis leur inflige un choc électrique bien senti.",learn:[[0,"stockpile"],[0,"spit-up"],[0,"swallow"],[12,"bubble-beam"],[16,"confuse-ray"],[20,"spark"],[24,"charge"],[30,"discharge"],[36,"aqua-ring"],[42,"flail"],[48,"take-down"],[54,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:172,name:"Pichu",key:"pichu",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:20,atk:40,def:15,spa:35,spd:35,spe:60},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:2,genus:"Pokémon Minisouris",flavor:"Les poches électriques de ses joues sont très petites. Lorsqu’elles sont surchargées, il s’électrocute lui-même.",learn:[[1,"tail-whip"],[1,"thunder-shock"],[4,"play-nice"],[8,"sweet-kiss"],[12,"nuzzle"],[16,"nasty-plot"],[20,"charm"]],baby:!0},{id:173,name:"Mélo",key:"cleffa",types:["fairy"],stats:{hp:50,atk:25,def:28,spa:45,spd:55,spe:15},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:3,genus:"Pokémon Étoile",flavor:"Il ressemble un peu à une étoile. On suppose qu’il est venu sur terre accroché à une météorite.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"splash"],[1,"copycat"],[4,"sing"],[8,"sweet-kiss"],[12,"disarming-voice"],[16,"encore"],[20,"charm"]],baby:!0},{id:174,name:"Toudoudou",key:"igglybuff",types:["normal","fairy"],stats:{hp:90,atk:30,def:15,spa:40,spd:20,spe:15},captureRate:170,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:1,genus:"Pokémon Bouboule",flavor:"Il se déplace en faisant rebondir son corps tout mou. Lorsque sa température corporelle augmente, il devient rose foncé.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"sing"],[1,"copycat"],[4,"defense-curl"],[8,"sweet-kiss"],[12,"disarming-voice"],[16,"disable"],[20,"charm"]],