ça, du magma en fusion circule dans le corps de ce Pokémon, apportant les nutriments et l’oxygène nécessaires à ses organes.",learn:[[1,"smog"],[1,"yawn"],[6,"ember"],[8,"rock-throw"],[13,"harden"],[20,"clear-smog"],[22,"ancient-power"],[27,"incinerate"],[29,"rock-slide"],[34,"lava-plume"],[36,"amnesia"],[41,"body-slam"],[43,"recover"],[48,"flamethrower"],[50,"earth-power"]]},{id:219,name:"Volcaropod",key:"magcargo",types:["fire","rock"],stats:{hp:60,atk:50,def:120,spa:90,spd:80,spe:30},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:55,genus:"Pokémon Lave",flavor:"La température de Volcaropod est d’environ 10 000 °C. L’eau s’évapore à son contact. Si ce Pokémon se retrouve sous la pluie, les gouttes d’eau forment de la vapeur et couvrent la zone de brouillard.",learn:[[0,"shell-smash"],[13,"harden"],[20,"clear-smog"],[22,"ancient-power"],[27,"incinerate"],[29,"rock-slide"],[34,"lava-plume"],[36,"amnesia"],[43,"body-slam"],[47,"recover"],[54,"flamethrower"]]},{id:220,name:"Marcacrin",key:"swinub",types:["ice","ground"],stats:{hp:50,atk:50,def:40,spa:30,spd:30,spe:50},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:6.5,genus:"Pokémon Cochon",flavor:"S’il sent une odeur attrayante, il fonce la tête la première pour trouver d’où elle vient.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"mud-slap"],[5,"powder-snow"],[10,"flail"],[15,"ice-shard"],[20,"mist"],[25,"endure"],[30,"icy-wind"],[35,"amnesia"],[40,"take-down"],[45,"earthquake"],[50,"blizzard"]]},{id:221,name:"Cochignon",key:"piloswine",types:["ice","ground"],stats:{hp:100,atk:100,def:80,spa:60,spd:60,spe:50},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:55.8,genus:"Pokémon Porc",flavor:"Bien qu’il soit pourvu de pattes courtes, ses sabots larges et pointus l’empêchent de glisser sur la glace.",learn:[[0,"ice-fang"],[15,"ice-shard"],[20,"mist"],[25,"endure"],[30,"icy-wind"],[37,"amnesia"],[44,"take-down"],[51,"earthquake"],[58,"blizzard"],[65,"thrash"]]},{id:222,name:"Corayon",key:"corsola",types:["water","rock"],stats:{hp:65,atk:55,def:95,spa:65,spd:95,spe:35},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:5,genus:"Pokémon Corail",flavor:"Ces Pokémon habitués des mers chaudes se trouvaient autrefois en masse sur les côtes de Galar.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"harden"],[5,"water-gun"],[10,"aqua-ring"],[15,"endure"],[20,"ancient-power"],[25,"bubble-beam"],[30,"flail"],[35,"life-dew"],[40,"power-gem"],[45,"earth-power"],[50,"recover"],[55,"mirror-coat"]]},{id:223,name:"Rémoraid",key:"remoraid",types:["water"],stats:{hp:35,atk:65,def:35,spa:65,spd:35,spe:65},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:12,genus:"Pokémon Jet",flavor:"À l’aide de sa nageoire dorsale en forme de ventouse, il s’accroche sous un Démanta pour récupérer ses restes.",learn:[[1,"water-gun"],[1,"helping-hand"],[4,"water-pulse"],[8,"focus-energy"],[12,"psybeam"],[16,"aurora-beam"],[20,"bubble-beam"],[24,"lock-on"],[28,"bullet-seed"],[32,"ice-beam"],[36,"hydro-pump"],[40,"soak"],[44,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:224,name:"Octillery",key:"octillery",types:["water"],stats:{hp:75,atk:105,def:75,spa:105,spd:75,spe:45},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:28.5,genus:"Pokémon Jet",flavor:"Il capture ses ennemis avec ses tentacules et les écrase ensuite avec sa tête dure comme la pierre.",learn:[[0,"octazooka"],[12,"psybeam"],[16,"aurora-beam"],[20,"bubble-beam"],[24,"lock-on"],[30,"bullet-seed"],[36,"ice-beam"],[42,"hydro-pump"],[48,"soak"],[54,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:225,name:"Cadoizo",key:"delibird",types:["ice","flying"],stats:{hp:45,atk:55,def:45,spa:65,spd:45,spe:75},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:16,genus:"Pokémon Livraison",flavor:"Ce Pokémon partage facilement son repas avec d’autres Pokémon et avec des humains, ce qui l’oblige à constamment courir après la nourriture.",learn:[[1,"present"],[25,"drill-peck"]]},{id:226,name:"Démanta",key:"mantine",types:["water","flying"],stats:{hp:85,atk:40,def:70,spa:80,spd:140,spe:70},captureRate:25,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.1,weight:220,genus:"Pokémon Cervolant",flavor:"Il nage paisiblement, sans se soucier des Rémoraid qui s’agrippent à lui pour lui voler ses restes.",learn:[[1,"wing-attack"],[1,"tackle"],[1,"supersonic"],[1,"water-gun"],[1,"psybeam"],[1,"bullet-seed"],[1,"roost"],[12,"water-pulse"],[16,"wide-guard"],[20,"agility"],[24,"bubble-beam"],[28,"headbutt"],[32,"air-slash"],[36,"aqua-ring"],[40,"bounce"],[44,"take-down"],[48,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:227,name:"Airmure",key:"skarmory",types:["steel","flying"],stats:{hp:65,atk:80,def:140,spa:40,spd:70,spe:70},captureRate:25,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.7,weight:50.5,genus:"Pokémon Armoiseau",flavor:"Ce Pokémon orne souvent les blasons, car les plumes qu’il perd sont utilisées pour forger des épées.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"peck"],[4,"sand-attack"],[8,"fury-attack"],[12,"metal-claw"],[16,"agility"],[20,"wing-attack"],[24,"slash"],[28,"steel-wing"],[32,"payback"],[36,"drill-peck"],[40,"metal-sound"],[44,"spikes"],[48,"iron-defense"],[52,"brave-bird"]]},{id:228,name:"Malosse",key:"houndour",types:["dark","fire"],stats:{hp:45,atk:60,def:30,spa:80,spd:50,spe:65},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:10.8,genus:"Pokémon Sombre",flavor:"Si ses congénères et lui poussent de sinistres hurlements avant l’aube, c’est pour signaler leur présence à tout le monde.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"ember"],[4,"howl"],[8,"smog"],[13,"roar"],[16,"bite"],[20,"incinerate"],[25,"beat-up"],[28,"fire-fang"],[32,"torment"],[37,"comeuppance"],[40,"foul-play"],[44,"flamethrower"],[49,"crunch"],[52,"nasty-plot"],[56,"inferno"]]},{id:229,name:"Démolosse",key:"houndoom",types:["dark","fire"],stats:{hp:75,atk:90,def:50,spa:110,spd:80,spe:95},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:35,genus:"Pokémon Sombre",flavor:"Ceux qui le craignaient jadis lui ont donné le surnom de « messager de la Faucheuse » à cause de son hurlement sinistre si particulier.",learn:[[13,"roar"],[16,"bite"],[20,"incinerate"],[26,"beat-up"],[30,"fire-fang"],[35,"torment"],[41,"comeuppance"],[45,"foul-play"],[50,"flamethrower"],[56,"crunch"],[62,"inferno"]]},{id:230,name:"Hyporoi",key:"kingdra",types:["water","dragon"],stats:{hp:75,atk:95,def:95,spa:95,spd:95,spe:85},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:152,genus:"Pokémon Dragon",flavor:"Les écailles qui se détachent de son corps brillent d’un éclat si élégant et si intense qu’on les offre aux familles royales.",learn:[[15,"focus-energy"],[20,"dragon-breath"],[25,"bubble-beam"],[30,"agility"],[37,"water-pulse"],[44,"dragon-pulse"],[51,"hydro-pump"],[58,"dragon-dance"],[65,"rain-dance"],[72,"wave-crash"]]},{id:231,name:"Phanpy",key:"phanpy",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:90,atk:60,def:60,spa:40,spd:40,spe:40},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:33.5,genus:"Pokémon Long-Nez",flavor:"Phanpy utilise sa petite trompe pour se doucher. Quand plusieurs d’entre eux se réunissent, ils s’arrosent joyeusement. On peut souvent voir ces Pokémon se sécher au bord de l’eau.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"growl"],[1,"defense-curl"],[6,"flail"],[10,"rollout"],[15,"bulldoze"],[19,"endure"],[24,"slam"],[28,"take-down"],[33,"charm"],[37,"last-resort"],[42,"double-edge"]]},{id:232,name:"Donphan",key:"donphan",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:90,atk:120,def:120,spa:60,spd:60,spe:50},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:120,genus:"Pokémon Armure",flavor:"Si Donphan décidait de charger, il pourrait détruire une maison. Grâce à sa force étonnante, ce Pokémon peut aider à déplacer les rochers et les coulées de boue qui bloquent les chemins de montagne.",learn:[[0,"fury-attack"],[6,"rapid-spin"],[10,"rollout"],[15,"assurance"],[19,"knock-off"],[24,"slam"],[30,"stomping-tantrum"],[37,"scary-face"],[43,"earthquake"],[50,"giga-impact"]]},{id:233,name:"Porygon2",key:"porygon2",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:85,atk:80,def:90,spa:105,spd:95,spe:60},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:32.5,genus:"Pokémon Virtuel",flavor:"Depuis qu’on l’a doté d’une intelligence artificielle, il parle un langage mystérieux que seuls ses congénères comprennent.",learn:[[15,"thunder-shock"],[20,"psybeam"],[25,"conversion-2"],[30,"agility"],[35,"recover"],[40,"discharge"],[45,"tri-attack"],[50,"lock-on"],[55,"zap-cannon"],[60,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:234,name:"Cerfrousse",key:"stantler",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:73,atk:95,def:62,spa:85,spd:65,spe:85},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:71.2,genus:"Pokémon Maxi Corne",flavor:"Les superbes bois de Cerfrousse étaient vendus très cher comme œuvres d’art. Ce Pokémon fut chassé et l’espèce proche de l’extinction à cause des gens qui recherchaient leurs précieux bois.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[3,"leer"],[7,"astonish"],[10,"hypnosis"],[13,"stomp"],[16,"sand-attack"],[21,"take-down"],[23,"confuse-ray"],[27,"calm-mind"],[32,"role-play"],[37,"zen-headbutt"],[49,"imprison"],[55,"double-edge"]]},{id:235,name:"Queulorior",key:"smeargle",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:55,atk:20,def:35,spa:20,spd:45,spe:75},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:58,genus:"Pokémon Peintre",flavor:"Il se sert du liquide qui sort de sa queue pour dessiner sa marque. Ses fans s’arrachent ses plus beaux tracés à prix d’or.",learn:[[1,"sketch"]]},{id:236,name:"Debugant",key:"tyrogue",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:35,atk:35,def:35,spa:35,spd:35,spe:35},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:21,genus:"Pokémon Bagarreur",flavor:"Même s’il est petit, il vaut mieux ne pas l’ignorer : quand il trouve un adversaire à sa hauteur, il frappe fort et souvent sans prévenir.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"focus-energy"],[1,"fake-out"],[1,"helping-hand"]],baby:!0},{id:237,name:"Kapoera",key:"hitmontop",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:50,atk:95,def:95,spa:35,spd:110,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:48,genus:"Pokémon Poirier",flavor:"Après avoir effectué un poirier visant à désorienter son adversaire, il lui assène des coups de pied furieux.",learn:[[0,"triple-kick"],[4,"quick-attack"],[8,"gyro-ball"],[12,"detect"],[16,"rapid-spin"],[21,"wide-guard"],[21,"quick-guard"],[24,"sucker-punch"],[28,"agility"],[32,"dig"],[36,"close-combat"],[40,"counter"],[44,"endeavor"]]},{id:238,name:"Lippouti",key:"smoochum",types:["ice","psychic"],stats:{hp:45,atk:30,def:15,spa:85,spd:65,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:6,genus:"Pokémon Bisou",flavor:"Ce Pokémon très curieux touche tout et n’importe quoi avec ses lèvres pour déterminer ce qu’il aime et ce qu’il déteste.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"lick"],[4,"powder-snow"],[8,"copycat"],[12,"confusion"],[16,"covet"],[20,"sing"],[24,"fake-tears"],[28,"ice-punch"],[32,"psychic"],[36,"sweet-kiss"],[40,"mean-look"],[44,"perish-song"],[48,"blizzard"]],baby:!0},{id:239,name:"Élekid",key:"elekid",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:45,atk:63,def:37,spa:65,spd:55,spe:95},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:23.5,genus:"Pokémon Électrique",flavor:"Il a encore du mal à emmagasiner l’électricité. Pour s’en nourrir, il se faufile dans les maisons à la recherche de prises électriques.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"quick-attack"],[4,"thunder-shock"],[8,"charge"],[12,"swift"],[16,"shock-wave"],[20,"thunder-wave"],[24,"screech"],[28,"thunder-punch"],[32,"discharge"],[36,"low-kick"],[40,"thunderbolt"],[44,"light-screen"],[48,"thunder"]],baby:!0},{id:240,name:"Magby",key:"magby",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:45,atk:75,def:37,spa:70,spd:55,spe:83},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:21.4,genus:"Pokémon Charbon",flavor:"Il vit près des volcans. À la fin de la journée, il se détend dans un bon bain de magma.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"smog"],[4,"ember"],[8,"smokescreen"],[12,"clear-smog"],[16,"flame-wheel"],[20,"confuse-ray"],[24,"scary-face"],[28,"fire-punch"],[32,"lava-plume"],[36,"low-kick"],[40,"flamethrower"],[44,"sunny-day"],[48,"fire-blast"]],baby:!0},{id:241,name:"Écrémeuh",key:"miltank",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:95,atk:80,def:105,sp