nt tout ce qu’ils touchent.",learn:[[1,"stomp"],[1,"leer"],[1,"ember"],[1,"smokescreen"],[6,"flame-wheel"],[12,"bite"],[18,"calm-mind"],[24,"roar"],[30,"fire-fang"],[36,"scary-face"],[42,"crunch"],[48,"extrasensory"],[54,"lava-plume"],[60,"swagger"],[66,"sunny-day"],[72,"fire-blast"],[78,"eruption"]]},{id:245,name:"Suicune",key:"suicune",types:["water"],stats:{hp:100,atk:75,def:115,spa:90,spd:115,spe:85},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:187,genus:"Pokémon Aurore",flavor:"Suicune incarne la tranquillité d’une source d’eau pure. Il parcourt les plaines avec grâce. Ce Pokémon a le pouvoir de purifier l’eau.",learn:[[1,"gust"],[1,"leer"],[1,"mist"],[1,"water-gun"],[6,"water-pulse"],[12,"bite"],[18,"calm-mind"],[24,"roar"],[30,"ice-fang"],[36,"tailwind"],[42,"crunch"],[48,"extrasensory"],[54,"surf"],[60,"mirror-coat"],[66,"rain-dance"],[72,"hydro-pump"],[78,"blizzard"]]},{id:246,name:"Embrylex",key:"larvitar",types:["rock","ground"],stats:{hp:50,atk:64,def:50,spa:45,spd:50,spe:41},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:72,genus:"Pokémon Peaupierre",flavor:"Il vit en se nourrissant de terre. Après avoir dévoré une montagne, il s’endort et entame sa croissance.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"leer"],[3,"rock-throw"],[6,"payback"],[9,"bite"],[12,"scary-face"],[15,"rock-slide"],[18,"stomping-tantrum"],[21,"screech"],[24,"smack-down"],[27,"crunch"],[31,"earthquake"],[33,"stone-edge"],[36,"thrash"],[39,"sandstorm"],[42,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:247,name:"Ymphect",key:"pupitar",types:["rock","ground"],stats:{hp:70,atk:84,def:70,spa:65,spd:70,spe:51},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:152,genus:"Pokémon Carapadure",flavor:"Malgré son état de chrysalide, il ne reste pas immobile. Sous sa solide carapace, ses pattes sortent déjà.",learn:[[0,"iron-defense"],[9,"bite"],[12,"scary-face"],[15,"rock-slide"],[18,"stomping-tantrum"],[21,"screech"],[24,"smack-down"],[27,"crunch"],[33,"earthquake"],[37,"stone-edge"],[42,"thrash"],[47,"sandstorm"],[52,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:248,name:"Tyranocif",key:"tyranitar",types:["rock","dark"],stats:{hp:100,atk:134,def:110,spa:95,spd:100,spe:61},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:202,genus:"Pokémon Armure",flavor:"Son pas est si lourd qu’il fait trembler le sol et s’écrouler même les plus grandes montagnes, ce qui altère la topographie de la zone.",learn:[[9,"bite"],[12,"scary-face"],[15,"rock-slide"],[18,"stomping-tantrum"],[21,"screech"],[24,"smack-down"],[27,"crunch"],[33,"earthquake"],[37,"stone-edge"],[42,"thrash"],[47,"sandstorm"],[52,"hyper-beam"],[59,"giga-impact"]]},{id:249,name:"Lugia",key:"lugia",types:["psychic","flying"],stats:{hp:106,atk:90,def:130,spa:90,spd:154,spe:110},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:5.2,weight:216,genus:"Pokémon Plongeon",flavor:"Les ailes de Lugia renferment une puissance dévastatrice. Un simple battement de ses ailes peut détruire de petites maisons. Du coup, ce Pokémon a choisi de vivre loin de tout, dans les profondeurs océaniques.",learn:[[1,"gust"],[1,"whirlwind"],[1,"ancient-power"],[1,"weather-ball"],[9,"mist"],[18,"safeguard"],[27,"calm-mind"],[36,"extrasensory"],[45,"recover"],[54,"aeroblast"],[63,"rain-dance"],[72,"hydro-pump"],[81,"future-sight"],[90,"sky-attack"]]},{id:250,name:"Ho-Oh",key:"ho-oh",types:["fire","flying"],stats:{hp:106,atk:130,def:90,spa:110,spd:154,spe:90},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:3.8,weight:199,genus:"Pokémon Arcenciel",flavor:"Les plumes de Ho-Oh brillent de sept couleurs selon l’orientation de son corps par rapport à la lumière. On raconte que ces plumes portent bonheur. On dit aussi que ce Pokémon vit au pied d’un arc-en-ciel.",learn:[[1,"gust"],[1,"whirlwind"],[1,"ancient-power"],[1,"weather-ball"],[9,"life-dew"],[18,"safeguard"],[27,"calm-mind"],[36,"extrasensory"],[45,"recover"],[54,"sacred-fire"],[63,"sunny-day"],[72,"fire-blast"],[81,"future-sight"],[90,"sky-attack"],[99,"overheat"]]},{id:251,name:"Celebi",key:"celebi",types:["psychic","grass"],stats:{hp:100,atk:100,def:100,spa:100,spd:100,spe:100},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!0,height:.6,weight:5,genus:"Pokémon Temporel",flavor:"Ce Pokémon venu du futur soigne les blessures et donne de la force aux plantes.",learn:[[1,"confusion"],[1,"heal-bell"],[10,"magical-leaf"],[20,"baton-pass"],[30,"ancient-power"],[40,"life-dew"],[50,"leech-seed"],[60,"recover"],[70,"future-sight"],[80,"healing-wish"],[90,"leaf-storm"],[100,"perish-song"]]},{id:252,name:"Arcko",key:"treecko",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:40,atk:45,def:35,spa:65,spd:55,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:5,genus:"Pokémon Bois Gecko",flavor:"Arcko est cool, calme et serein. Il ne panique jamais, quelle que soit la situation. Quand un ennemi plus gros que lui lui lance un regard de défi, ce Pokémon reste stoïque et ne cède pas un centimètre de terrain.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"leer"],[3,"leafage"],[6,"quick-attack"],[9,"mega-drain"],[12,"detect"],[15,"quick-guard"],[18,"assurance"],[21,"giga-drain"],[24,"slam"],[27,"double-team"],[30,"energy-ball"],[33,"screech"],[36,"endeavor"],[39,"leaf-storm"]]},{id:253,name:"Massko",key:"grovyle",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:50,atk:65,def:45,spa:85,spd:65,spe:95},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:21.6,genus:"Pokémon Bois Gecko",flavor:"Ce Pokémon vole de branche en branche avec brio. En forêt, aucun Pokémon, même le plus rapide, ne peut espérer attraper un Massko qui s’enfuit.",learn:[[9,"mega-drain"],[12,"detect"],[15,"quick-guard"],[20,"assurance"],[25,"giga-drain"],[30,"slam"],[35,"double-team"],[40,"leaf-blade"],[45,"screech"],[50,"endeavor"],[55,"leaf-storm"]]},{id:254,name:"Jungko",key:"sceptile",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:70,atk:85,def:65,spa:105,spd:85,spe:120},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.7,weight:52.2,genus:"Pokémon Forêt",flavor:"Jungko a des graines qui lui poussent sur le dos. On dit qu’elles regorgent de nutriments qui revitalisent les arbres. Ce Pokémon s’occupe des forêts avec amour.",learn:[[0,"leaf-blade"],[5,"mega-drain"],[12,"detect"],[15,"quick-guard"],[20,"assurance"],[25,"giga-drain"],[30,"slam"],[35,"double-team"],[42,"screech"],[49,"endeavor"],[56,"leaf-storm"]]},{id:255,name:"Poussifeu",key:"torchic",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:45,atk:60,def:40,spa:70,spd:50,spe:45},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:2.5,genus:"Pokémon Poussin",flavor:"Poussifeu dispose d’un endroit dans son corps pour stocker sa flamme. Si on lui fait un gros câlin, sa flamme s’illumine chaleureusement. Ce Pokémon est couvert d’un duvet très doux.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"growl"],[3,"ember"],[6,"quick-attack"],[9,"flame-charge"],[12,"detect"],[15,"sand-attack"],[18,"aerial-ace"],[21,"slash"],[24,"bounce"],[27,"focus-energy"],[30,"flamethrower"],[33,"feather-dance"],[36,"reversal"],[39,"flare-blitz"]]},{id:256,name:"Galifeu",key:"combusken",types:["fire","fighting"],stats:{hp:60,atk:85,def:60,spa:85,spd:60,spe:55},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:19.5,genus:"Pokémon Poulet",flavor:"Galifeu combat grâce aux flammes ardentes qu’il crache de son bec et à ses coups de pied destructeurs. Le cri de ce Pokémon est très puissant et très gênant pour l’adversaire.",learn:[[0,"double-kick"],[9,"flame-charge"],[12,"detect"],[15,"sand-attack"],[20,"aerial-ace"],[25,"slash"],[30,"bounce"],[35,"focus-energy"],[40,"blaze-kick"],[45,"bulk-up"],[50,"reversal"],[55,"flare-blitz"]]},{id:257,name:"Braségali",key:"blaziken",types:["fire","fighting"],stats:{hp:80,atk:120,def:70,spa:110,spd:70,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.9,weight:52,genus:"Pokémon Ardent",flavor:"Braségali a des jambes incroyablement puissantes. Il peut sauter par-dessus un immeuble de trente étages. Les coups de poing enflammés de ce Pokémon peuvent carboniser ses ennemis.",learn:[[0,"blaze-kick"],[9,"flame-charge"],[12,"detect"],[15,"sand-attack"],[20,"aerial-ace"],[25,"slash"],[30,"bounce"],[35,"focus-energy"],[42,"bulk-up"],[49,"reversal"],[56,"flare-blitz"],[63,"brave-bird"]]},{id:258,name:"Gobou",key:"mudkip",types:["water"],stats:{hp:50,atk:70,def:50,spa:50,spd:50,spe:40},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:7.6,genus:"Pokémon Poissonboue",flavor:"Sous l’eau, Gobou peut respirer grâce aux branchies sur ses joues. S’il se retrouve en difficulté pendant un combat, ce Pokémon déchaîne ses pouvoirs incroyables. Il peut détruire des rochers plus gros que lui.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"growl"],[3,"water-gun"],[6,"rock-smash"],[9,"rock-throw"],[12,"protect"],[15,"supersonic"],[18,"water-pulse"],[21,"rock-slide"],[24,"take-down"],[27,"amnesia"],[30,"surf"],[33,"screech"],[36,"endeavor"],[39,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:259,name:"Flobio",key:"marshtomp",types:["water","ground"],stats:{hp:70,atk:85,def:70,spa:60,spd:70,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:28,genus:"Pokémon Poissonboue",flavor:"Flobio est bien plus rapide dans la boue que dans l’eau. L’arrière-train de ce Pokémon est particulièrement développé, ce qui lui donne la capacité de marcher sur ses pattes arrière.",learn:[[0,"mud-shot"],[9,"rock-throw"],[12,"protect"],[15,"supersonic"],[20,"water-pulse"],[25,"rock-slide"],[30,"take-down"],[35,"amnesia"],[40,"muddy-water"],[45,"screech"],[50,"endeavor"],[55,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:260,name:"Laggron",key:"swampert",types:["water","ground"],stats:{hp:100,atk:110,def:90,spa:85,spd:90,spe:60},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:81.9,genus:"Pokémon Poissonboue",flavor:"Laggron peut prédire l’arrivée des tempêtes en utilisant ses nageoires pour sentir les variations dans les vagues et les marées. Si une tempête s’approche, il empile des rochers pour protéger son habitat.",learn:[[9,"rock-throw"],[12,"protect"],[15,"supersonic"],[20,"water-pulse"],[25,"rock-slide"],[30,"take-down"],[35,"amnesia"],[42,"muddy-water"],[49,"screech"],[56,"endeavor"],[63,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:261,name:"Medhyèna",key:"poochyena",types:["dark"],stats:{hp:35,atk:55,def:35,spa:30,spd:30,spe:35},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:13.6,genus:"Pokémon Morsure",flavor:"Medhyèna est omnivore. Il mange de tout. Ses crocs sont très gros, comparés à son corps. Ce Pokémon essaie d’intimider ses ennemis en hérissant les poils de sa queue.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[4,"howl"],[7,"sand-attack"],[10,"bite"],[13,"leer"],[16,"roar"],[19,"swagger"],[22,"assurance"],[25,"scary-face"],[28,"taunt"],[31,"crunch"],[34,"yawn"],[36,"take-down"],[40,"sucker-punch"],[44,"play-rough"]]},{id:262,name:"Grahyèna",key:"mightyena",types:["dark"],stats:{hp:70,atk:90,def:70,spa:60,spd:60,spe:70},captureRate:127,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:37,genus:"Pokémon Morsure",flavor:"Les Grahyèna vivent et se déplacent en meute. Leurs réminiscences de la vie sauvage les poussent à n’obéir qu’aux Dresseurs qu’ils considèrent comme réellement talentueux.",learn:[[0,"snarl"],[13,"leer"],[13,"howl"],[16,"roar"],[20,"swagger"],[24,"assurance"],[28,"scary-face"],[36,"taunt"],[44,"yawn"],[48,"take-down"],[52,"sucker-punch"],[56,"play-rough"]]},{id:263,name:"Zigzaton",key:"zigzagoon",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:38,atk:30,def:41,spa:30,spd:41,spe:60},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:17.5,genus:"Pokémon Petit Raton",flavor:"Le Zigzaton de Galar a adopté cette forme dans les autres régions. Il est très doué pour dénicher des choses.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"growl"],[3,"sand-attack"],[6,"tail-whip"],[9,"covet"],[12,"headbutt"],[15,"baby-doll-eyes"],[18,"pin-missile"],[21,"rest"],[24,"take-down"],[27,"fling"],[30,"flail"],[33,"belly-drum"],[36,"double-edge"]]},{id:264,name:"Linéon",key:"linoone",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:78,atk:70,def:61,spa:50,spd:61,spe:100},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:32.5,genus:"Pokémon Fonceur",flavor:"Il se sert de sa force de propulsion et de ses griffes aiguisées pour achever ses proies. Il a du mal à courir sur les routes sinueuses.",learn:[[0,"slash"],[9,"covet"],[12,"headbutt"],[15,"hone-claws"],[18,"fury-swipes"],[23,"rest"],[28,"take-down"],[33,"fling"],[38,"flail"],[43,"belly-drum"],[48,"double-edge"]]},{id:265,name:"Chenipotte",key:"wurmple",types:["bug"],stats:{hp:45,atk:45,def:35,spa:20,spd:30,spe:20},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:3.6,genus:"Pokémon Ver",flavor:"Chenipotte est la proie de Hélédelle. Ce Pokémon essaie de résister en dirigeant les pointes de son dos vers le prédateur. Il affaiblit son ennemi en lui injectant du poison.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"string-shot"],[5,"poison-sting"],[15,"bug-bite"]]},{id:266,name:"Armulys",key:"silcoon",types:["bug"],stats:{hp:50,atk:35,def:55,spa:25,spd:25,spe:15},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:10,genus:"Pokémon Cocon",flavor:"On pensait qu’Armulys pouvait résister à la faim et ne consommait rien avant son évolution. On sait maintenant que ce Pokémon étanche sa soif en récupérant l’eau de pluie déposée sur sa soie.",learn:[[0,"harden"]]},{id:267,name:"Charmillon",key:"beautifly",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:60,atk:70,def:50,spa:100,spd:50,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:28.4,genus:"Pokémon Papillon",flavor:"Charmillon a une longue trompe en spirale, particulièrement pratique pour récupérer le pollen des fleurs. Ce Pokémon se laisse porter par les vents printaniers pendant qu’il butine.",learn:[[0,"gust"],[12,"absorb"],[15,"stun-spore"],[17,"morning-sun"],[20,"air-cutter"],[22,"mega-drain"],[25,"leech-life"],[27,"attract"],[30,"whirlwind"],[32,"giga-drain"],[35,"bug-buzz"],[37,"protect"],[40,"quiver-dance"]]},{id:268,name:"Blindalys",key:"cascoon",types:["bug"],stats:{hp:50,atk:35,def:55,spa:25,spd:25,spe:15},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:11.5,genus:"Pokémon Cocon",flavor:"Lorsqu’il est attaqué, Blindalys reste immobile, même s’il a très mal. En effet, s’il bougeait, son corps serait affaibli lors de son évolution. En revanche, ce Pokémon n’oubliera pas la douleur endurée.",learn:[[0,"harden"]]},{id:269,name:"Papinox",key:"dustox",types:["bug","poison"],stats:{hp:60,atk:50,def:70,spa:50,spd:90,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:31.6,genus:"Pokémon Papipoison",flavor:"Lorsque Papinox bat des ailes, une légère poussière se répand. Cette poussière est en fait un puissant poison capable de mettre au tapis un boxeur professionnel. Ce Pokémon cherche sa nourriture avec ses antennes, comme un radar.",learn:[[0,"gust"],[12,"confusion"],[15,"poison-powder"],[17,"moonlight"],[20,"venoshock"],[22,"psybeam"],[25,"leech-life"],[27,"light-screen"],[30,"whirlwind"],[32,"toxic"],[35,"bug-buzz"],[37,"protect"],[40,"quiver-dance"]]},{id:270,name:"Nénupiot",key:"lotad",types:["water","grass"],stats:{hp:40,atk:30,def:30,spa:40,spd:50,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:2.6,genus:"Pokémon Aquaplante",flavor:"Sa feuille est devenue si grande et si lourde qu’il doit vivre en flottant sur l’eau.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"astonish"],[3,"absorb"],[6,"water-gun"],[9,"mist"],[12,"mega-drain"],[16,"flail"],[20,"bubble-beam"],[24,"leech-seed"],[28,"giga-drain"],[33,"rain-dance"],[38,"zen-headbutt"],[43,"energy-ball"]]},{id:271,name:"Lombre",key:"lombre",types:["water","grass"],stats:{hp:60,atk:50,def:50,spa:60,spd:70,spe:50},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:32.5,genus:"Pokémon Jovial",flavor:"Il vit au bord de l’eau dans les endroits ensoleillés. Il s’endort sur un tas d’algues dans la journée et ne se lève qu’à la nuit tombée.",learn:[[9,"mist"],[12,"mega-drain"],[18,"fury-swipes"],[24,"bubble-beam"],[30,"leech-seed"],[36,"giga-drain"],[50,"zen-headbutt"],[57,"energy-ball"],[64,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:272,name:"Ludicolo",key:"ludicolo",types:["water","grass"],stats:{hp:80,atk:70,def:70,spa:90,spd:100,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:55,genus:"Pokémon Insouciant",flavor:"Il bouge son corps sur un rythme entraînant pour décupler ses forces.",learn:[]},{id:273,name:"Grainipiot",key:"seedot",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:40,atk:40,def:50,spa:30,spd:30,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:4,genus:"Pokémon Gland",flavor:"Il se suspend aux branches par l’extrémité de sa tête. Il arrive qu’une bourrasque le fasse tomber.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"harden"],[3,"absorb"],[6,"astonish"],[9,"growth"],[12,"rollout"],[15,"mega-drain"],[18,"payback"],[21,"headbutt"],[24,"sunny-day"],[27,"synthesis"],[30,"sucker-punch"],[33,"explosion"]]},{id:274,name:"Pifeuil",key:"nuzleaf",types:["grass","dark"],stats:{hp:70,atk:70,def:40,spa:60,spd:40,spe:60},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:28,genus:"Pokémon Malin",flavor:"Il vit dans les trous des grands arbres. Le sifflement qu’il produit avec sa feuille suffit à remplir ses adversaires d’effroi.",learn:[[0,"razor-leaf"],[9,"growth"],[12,"rollout"],[18,"mega-drain"],[24,"payback"],[30,"synthesis"],[36,"sunny-day"],[43,"extrasensory"],[50,"sucker-punch"],[57,"leaf-blade"]]},{id:275,name:"Tengalice",key:"shiftry",types:["grass","dark"],stats:{hp:90,atk:100,def:60,spa:90,spd:60,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:59.6,genus:"Pokémon Malveillant",flavor:"Il vit caché au fond des forêts. On raconte qu’il fait souffler la bise lorsqu’il agite ses grands éventails.",learn:[[0,"leaf-blade"]]},{id:276,name:"Nirondelle",key:"taillow",types:["normal","flying"],stats:{hp:40,atk:55,def:30,spa:30,spd:30,spe:85},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:2.3,genus:"Pokémon Minirondel",flavor:"Nirondelle est jeune. Il vient de quitter son nid. Du coup, il se sent parfois un peu seul et pleure la nuit. Ce Pokémon se nourrit des Chenipotte qu’il trouve dans les forêts.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"peck"],[5,"focus-energy"],[9,"quick-attack"],[13,"wing-attack"],[17,"double-team"],[21,"aerial-ace"],[25,"quick-guard"],[29,"agility"],[33,"air-slash"],[37,"endeavor"],[41,"brave-bird"],[45,"reversal"]]},{id:277,name:"Hélédelle",key:"swellow",types:["normal","flying"],stats:{hp:60,atk:85,def:60,spa:75,spd:50,spe:125},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:19.8,genus:"Pokémon Hirondelle",flavor:"Hélédelle fait attention à bien entretenir ses ailes brillantes. Lorsque deux Hélédelle se rencontrent, ils se nettoient mutuellement les ailes avec attention.",learn:[[13,"wing-attack"],[17,"double-team"],[21,"aerial-ace"],[27,"quick-guard"],[33,"agility"],[45,"endeavor"],[57,"reversal"]]},{id:278,name:"Goélise",key:"wingull",types:["water","flying"],stats:{hp:40,atk:30,def:30,spa:55,spd:30,spe:85},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:9.5,genus:"Pokémon Mouette",flavor:"Il niche dans les falaises. En utilisant les courants d’air, il peut voler sans battre des ailes.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"water-gun"],[5,"quick-attack"],[10,"supersonic"],[15,"wing-attack"],[20,"water-pulse"],[26,"agility"],[30,"air-slash"],[35,"mist"],[40,"roost"],[45,"hurricane"]]},{id:279,name:"Bekipan",key:"pelipper",types:["water","flying"],stats:{hp:60,atk:50,def:100,spa:95,spd:70,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:28,genus:"Pokémon Oiseaudo",flavor:"Avec son grand bec, il transporte de la nourriture qu’il a récoltée en volant la bouche ouverte au ras de la mer, gobant de l’eau au passage.",learn:[[15,"wing-attack"],[20,"water-pulse"],[28,"stockpile"],[28,"spit-up"],[28,"swallow"],[34,"fling"],[41,"mist"],[48,"roost"],[55,"hurricane"],[62,"hydro-pump"]]},{id:280,name:"Tarsal",key:"ralts",types:["psychic","fairy"],stats:{hp:28,atk:25,def:25,spa:45,spd:35,spe:40},captureRate:235,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:6.6,genus:"Pokémon Sentiment",flavor:"Quand ses cornes rouges captent les ondes positives d’un Pokémon ou d’un humain, tout son corps se réchauffe.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"disarming-voice"],[3,"double-team"],[6,"confusion"],[9,"hypnosis"],[12,"draining-kiss"],[15,"teleport"],[18,"psybeam"],[21,"life-dew"],[24,"charm"],[27,"calm-mind"],[30,"psychic"],[33,"heal-pulse"],[36,"dream-eater"],[39,"future-sight"]]},{id:281,name:"Kirlia",key:"kirlia",types:["psychic","fairy"],stats:{hp:38,atk:35,def:35,spa:65,spd:55,spe:50},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:20.2,genus:"Pokémon Émotion",flavor:"Il peut distordre l’espace-temps grâce à ses pouvoirs psychiques et ainsi voir l’avenir.",learn:[[9,"hypnosis"],[12,"draining-kiss"],[15,"teleport"],[18,"psybeam"],[23,"life-dew"],[28,"charm"],[33,"calm-mind"],[38,"psychic"],[43,"heal-pulse"],[48,"dream-eater"],[53,"future-sight"]]},{id:282,name:"Gardevoir",key:"gardevoir",types:["psychic","fairy"],stats:{hp:68,atk:65,def:65,spa:125,spd:115,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.6,weight:48.4,genus:"Pokémon Étreinte",flavor:"Prêt à tout pour protéger son Dresseur, il peut aller jusqu’à épuiser sa force mentale pour créer un mini trou noir.",learn:[[0,"dazzling-gleam"],[9,"hypnosis"],[12,"draining-kiss"],[15,"teleport"],[18,"psybeam"],[23,"life-dew"],[28,"wish"],[35,"calm-mind"],[42,"psychic"],[49,"moonblast"],[56,"dream-eater"],[63,"future-sight"]]},{id:283,name:"Arakdo",key:"surskit",types:["bug","water"],stats:{hp:40,atk:30,def:32,spa:50,spd:52,spe:65},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:1.7,genus:"Pokémon Maresurfeur",flavor:"Il vit dans les lacs ou les marais où prospèrent les plantes hydrophiles. Il se dispute souvent proies et territoire avec son voisin, Araqua.",learn:[[1,"water-gun"],[6,"quick-attack"],[9,"sweet-scent"],[14,"soak"],[17,"bubble-beam"],[22,"agility"],[25,"mist"],[25,"haze"],[35,"baton-pass"],[38,"sticky-web"]]},{id:284,name:"Maskadra",key:"masquerain",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:70,atk:60,def:62,spa:100,spd:82,spe:80},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:3.6,genus:"Pokémon Boule Œil",flavor:"Ses antennes en forme d’ailes absorbent facilement l’humidité. Par temps de pluie, il attend patiemment au creux d’un arbre.",learn:[[17,"gust"],[22,"scary-face"],[22,"air-cutter"],[26,"stun-spore"],[32,"air-slash"],[38,"giga-drain"],[44,"bug-buzz"],[52,"quiver-dance"]]},{id:285,name:"Balignon",key:"shroomish",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:60,atk:40,def:60,spa:40,spd:60,spe:35},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:4.5,genus:"Pokémon Champignon",flavor:"Lorsque Balignon sent un danger, il secoue son corps et répand ses spores du haut de sa tête. Les spores de ce Pokémon sont si toxiques qu’elles font dépérir les arbres et les herbes.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"absorb"],[5,"stun-spore"],[8,"leech-seed"],[12,"mega-drain"],[15,"headbutt"],[19,"poison-powder"],[26,"giga-drain"],[29,"growth"],[33,"toxic"],[36,"seed-bomb"],[40,"spore"]]},{id:286,name:"Chapignon",key:"breloom",types:["grass","fighting"],stats:{hp:60,atk:130,def:80,spa:60,spd:60,spe:70},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:39.2,genus:"Pokémon Champignon",flavor:"Les graines autour de la queue de Chapignon sont des spores toxiques. Elles sont totalement immangeables. Une simple bouchée d’une graine de ce Pokémon peut causer de grandes douleurs à l’estomac.",learn:[[0,"mach-punch"],[12,"mega-drain"],[15,"headbutt"],[19,"feint"],[22,"counter"],[28,"force-palm"],[33,"worry-seed"],[39,"brick-break"],[44,"seed-bomb"],[50,"dynamic-punch"],[55,"focus-punch"]]},{id:287,name:"Parecool",key:"slakoth",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:60,atk:60,def:60,spa:35,spd:35,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:24,genus:"Pokémon Flâneur",flavor:"Le cœur de Parecool ne bat qu’une fois par minute. Quoi qu’il arrive, il se contente de s’avachir, immobile. Il est très rare de voir ce Pokémon se déplacer.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"yawn"],[6,"encore"],[9,"slack-off"],[14,"headbutt"],[17,"amnesia"],[22,"covet"],[25,"throat-chop"],[30,"counter"],[33,"flail"],[38,"play-rough"]]},{id:288,name:"Vigoroth",key:"vigoroth",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:80,atk:80,def:80,spa:55,spd:55,spe:90},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:46.5,genus:"Pokémon Turbusinge",flavor:"Vigoroth ne tient pas en place. Même quand il essaie de dormir, le sang dans ses veines s’agite, obligeant ce Pokémon à courir comme un fou dans la forêt pour s’épuiser afin de pouvoir se reposer.",learn:[[14,"fury-swipes"],[17,"endure"],[23,"slash"],[27,"throat-chop"],[33,"counter"],[37,"focus-punch"],[43,"reversal"]]},{id:289,name:"Monaflèmit",key:"slaking",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:150,atk:160,def:100,spa:95,spd:65,spe:100},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:130.5,genus:"Pokémon Fainéant",flavor:"On trouve parfois des cercles de plus de 1 m de rayon totalement désherbés dans les plaines. Ils sont faits par les Monaflèmit qui passent leurs journées allongés à manger toute l’herbe à portée de main.",learn:[[0,"swagger"],[17,"amnesia"],[23,"covet"],[27,"throat-chop"],[33,"counter"],[39,"flail"],[45,"fling"],[52,"mega-kick"],[63,"hammer-arm"]]},{id:290,name:"Ningale",key:"nincada",types:["bug","ground"],stats:{hp:31,atk:45,def:90,spa:30,spd:30,spe:40},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:5.5,genus:"Pokémon Apprenti",flavor:"Il peut passer plus de dix ans sous terre. Les racines des arbres constituent son régime alimentaire.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"sand-attack"],[5,"harden"],[10,"false-swipe"],[15,"mud-slap"],[21,"absorb"],[25,"metal-claw"],[30,"fury-swipes"],[35,"mind-reader"],[40,"dig"]]},{id:291,name:"Ninjask",key:"ninjask",types:["bug","flying"],stats:{hp:61,atk:90,def:45,spa:50,spd:50,spe:160},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:12,genus:"Pokémon Ninja",flavor:"Ce Pokémon est tellement rapide qu’on le dit capable d’éviter toutes les attaques. Il adore se nourrir de la sève sucrée des arbres.",learn:[[0,"screech"],[0,"double-team"],[0,"fury-cutter"],[15,"agility"],[23,"absorb"],[29,"bug-bite"],[36,"fury-swipes"],[43,"mind-reader"],[50,"slash"],[57,"swords-dance"],[64,"x-scissor"]]},{id:292,name:"Munja",key:"shedinja",types:["bug","ghost"],stats:{hp:1,atk:90,def:45,spa:30,spd:30,spe:40},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:1.2,genus:"Pokémon Exuvie",flavor:"Cet étrange Pokémon, dont le corps est comme une coquille vide, ne respire pas et peut voler sans battre des ailes.",learn:[[15,"confuse-ray"],[23,"absorb"],[29,"shadow-sneak"],[36,"fury-swipes"],[43,"mind-reader"],[50,"shadow-ball"],[57,"spite"],[64,"phantom-force"]]},{id:293,name:"Chuchmur",key:"whismur",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:64,atk:51,def:23,spa:51,spd:23,spe:28},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:16.3,genus:"Pokémon Chuchoteur",flavor:"Quand il se met à crier, il se surprend lui-même et hurle de plus belle. Il continue ainsi jusqu’à ce qu’il se fatigue et tombe de sommeil.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"astonish"],[5,"echoed-voice"],[10,"howl"],[15,"rest"],[15,"sleep-talk"],[21,"stomp"],[25,"roar"],[30,"supersonic"],[35,"uproar"],[40,"screech"],[45,"hyper-voice"]]},{id:294,name:"Ramboum",key:"loudred",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:84,atk:71,def:43,spa:71,spd:43,spe:48},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:40.5,genus:"Pokémon Grosse Voix",flavor:"Ses hurlements n’affectent pas seulement l’ouïe ; ils provoquent aussi une onde de choc qui balaie les ennemis et leur inflige des dégâts.",learn:[[0,"bite"],[15,"rest"],[15,"sleep-talk"],[23,"stomp"],[29,"roar"],[36,"supersonic"],[43,"uproar"],[50,"screech"],[57,"hyper-voice"]]},{id:295,name:"Brouhabam",key:"exploud",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:104,atk:91,def:63,spa:91,spd:73,spe:68},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:84,genus:"Pokémon Bruit Sourd",flavor:"Pour communiquer avec ses semblables, il n’utilise pas que son cri puissant ; il émet aussi des sons par les trous de son corps.",learn:[[0,"crunch"],[15,"rest"],[15,"sleep-talk"],[23,"stomp"],[29,"roar"],[36,"supersonic"],[45,"uproar"],[54,"screech"],[63,"hyper-voice"],[72,"boomburst"],[81,"hyper-beam"]]},{id:296,name:"Makuhita",key:"makuhita",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:72,atk:60,def:30,spa:20,spd:30,spe:25},captureRate:180,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:86.4,genus:"Pokémon Tenace",flavor:"Il existerait un plat mijoté traditionnel que les Dresseurs cuisinent pour rendre leur Makuhita encore plus fort.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"focus-energy"],[4,"sand-attack"],[7,"arm-thrust"],[10,"fake-out"],[13,"force-palm"],[16,"whirlwind"],[19,"knock-off"],[22,"bulk-up"],[25,"belly-drum"],[28,"detect"],[31,"seismic-toss"],[34,"focus-punch"],[37,"endure"],[40,"close-combat"],[43,"reversal"],[46,"heavy-slam"]]},{id:297,name:"Hariyama",key:"hariyama",types:["fighting"],stats:{hp:144,atk:120,def:60,spa:40,spd:60,spe:50},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.3,weight:253.8,genus:"Pokémon Cogneur",flavor:"Les Hariyama les plus forts ne sont pas forcément les plus grands. Les petits gabarits aussi ont plus d’un tour dans leur sac.",learn:[[10,"fake-out"],[13,"force-palm"],[16,"whirlwind"],[19,"knock-off"],[22,"bulk-up"],[26,"belly-drum"],[30,"detect"],[34,"seismic-toss"],[38,"focus-punch"],[42,"endure"],[46,"close-combat"],[50,"reversal"],[54,"heavy-slam"],[60,"headlong-rush"]]},{id:298,name:"Azurill",key:"azurill",types:["normal","fairy"],stats:{hp:50,atk:20,def:40,spa:20,spd:40,spe:20},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.2,weight:2,genus:"Pokémon Point Polka",flavor:"C’est un Pokémon docile, mais si on l’énerve, il n’hésite pas à frapper en faisant tournoyer la grosse boule au bout de sa queue.",learn:[[1,"tail-whip"],[1,"water-gun"],[1,"splash"],[3,"helping-hand"],[6,"bubble-beam"],[9,"charm"],[12,"slam"],[15,"bounce"]],baby:!0},{id:299,name:"Tarinor",key:"nosepass",types:["rock"],stats:{hp:30,atk:45,def:135,spa:45,spd:90,spe:30},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:97,genus:"Pokémon Boussole",flavor:"Grâce à sa force magnétique, il peut chasser ses proies sans se déplacer, mais il attire parfois ses pires ennemis.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[4,"harden"],[7,"block"],[10,"rock-throw"],[13,"thunder-wave"],[16,"rest"],[19,"spark"],[22,"rock-slide"],[25,"power-gem"],[28,"rock-blast"],[31,"discharge"],[34,"sandstorm"],[37,"earth-power"],[40,"stone-edge"],[43,"zap-cannon"],[43,"lock-on"]]},{id:300,name:"Skitty",key:"skitty",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:50,atk:45,def:45,spa:35,spd:35,spe:50},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:11,genus:"Pokémon Chaton",flavor:"On sait que Skitty court souvent après sa queue. À l’état sauvage, ce Pokémon vit dans les cavités des arbres de la forêt. Il est tellement adorable qu’il a un grand succès comme animal de compagnie.",learn:[[1,"tail-whip"],[1,"growl"],[1,"fake-out"],[4,"tackle"],[7,"sing"],[10,"attract"],[13,"disarming-voice"],[16,"fury-swipes"],[19,"copycat"],[22,"payback"],[25,"charm"],[31,"facade"],[34,"covet"],[37,"heal-bell"],[40,"double-edge"],[43,"baby-doll-eyes"],[46,"play-rough"]]},{id:301,name:"Delcatty",key:"delcatty",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:70,atk:65,def:65,spa:55,spd:55,spe:90},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:32.6,genus:"Pokémon Guindé",flavor:"Delcatty peut dormir n’importe où. Il n’a pas de nid permanent. Lorsque d’autres Pokémon lui cherchent des noises pendant son sommeil, il ne répond pas et se contente de partir dormir ailleurs.",learn:[]},{id:302,name:"Ténéfix",key:"sableye",types:["dark","ghost"],stats:{hp:50,atk:75,def:75,spa:65,spd:65,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:11,genus:"Pokémon Obscurité",flavor:"Ce Pokémon se nourrit de pierres précieuses. Dans les ténèbres, ses yeux brillent du reflet des joyaux.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"leer"],[3,"astonish"],[9,"shadow-sneak"],[12,"fake-out"],[15,"disable"],[18,"detect"],[21,"night-shade"],[24,"fury-swipes"],[27,"knock-off"],[30,"quash"],[33,"shadow-claw"],[36,"mean-look"],[39,"power-gem"],[42,"zen-headbutt"],[45,"shadow-ball"],[48,"foul-play"]]},{id:303,name:"Mysdibule",key:"mawile",types:["steel","fairy"],stats:{hp:50,atk:85,def:85,spa:55,spd:55,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:11.5,genus:"Pokémon Trompeur",flavor:"Ses cornes d’acier forment une grande mâchoire avec laquelle il mord férocement ses adversaires.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"astonish"],[4,"fairy-wind"],[8,"baton-pass"],[12,"bite"],[16,"stockpile"],[16,"spit-up"],[16,"swallow"],[20,"sucker-punch"],[24,"iron-defense"],[28,"crunch"],[32,"sweet-scent"],[36,"iron-head"],[40,"taunt"],[44,"fake-tears"],[48,"play-rough"]]},{id:304,name:"Galekid",key:"aron",types:["steel","rock"],stats:{hp:50,atk:70,def:100,spa:40,spd:40,spe:30},captureRate:180,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:60,genus:"Pokémon Armurfer",flavor:"Quand il évolue, il perd son armure d’acier. Autrefois, les gens la ramassaient pour en faire usage dans leur vie quotidienne.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"harden"],[4,"metal-claw"],[8,"rock-tomb"],[12,"roar"],[16,"headbutt"],[20,"protect"],[24,"rock-slide"],[28,"iron-head"],[33,"metal-sound"],[36,"take-down"],[40,"autotomize"],[44,"iron-tail"],[48,"iron-defense"],[52,"heavy-slam"],[56,"double-edge"],[60,"metal-burst"]]},{id:305,name:"Galegon",key:"lairon",types:["steel","rock"],stats:{hp:60,atk:90,def:140,spa:50,spd:50,spe:40},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:120,genus:"Pokémon Armurfer",flavor:"Les Galegon se disputent les territoires en luttant au corps à corps, comme le montrent les éraflures sur leur armure d’acier.",learn:[[12,"roar"],[16,"headbutt"],[20,"protect"],[24,"rock-slide"],[28,"iron-head"],[35,"metal-sound"],[40,"take-down"],[46,"autotomize"],[52,"iron-tail"],[58,"iron-defense"],[64,"heavy-slam"],[70,"double-edge"],[76,"metal-burst"]]},{id:306,name:"Galeking",key:"aggron",types:["steel","rock"],stats:{hp:70,atk:110,def:180,spa:60,spd:60,spe:50},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.1,weight:360,genus:"Pokémon Armurfer",flavor:"Il y a fort longtemps, un roi portait un casque à l’effigie de Galeking, pensant qu’il pourrait ainsi s’approprier sa force.",learn:[[12,"roar"],[16,"headbutt"],[20,"protect"],[24,"rock-slide"],[28,"iron-head"],[35,"metal-sound"],[40,"take-down"],[48,"autotomize"],[56,"iron-tail"],[64,"iron-defense"],[72,"heavy-slam"],[80,"double-edge"],[88,"metal-burst"]]},{id:307,name:"Méditikka",key:"meditite",types:["fighting","psychic"],stats:{hp:30,atk:40,def:55,spa:40,spd:55,spe:60},captureRate:180,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:11.2,genus:"Pokémon Méditation",flavor:"Méditikka intensifie son énergie intérieure grâce à la méditation. Il lui suffit d’une Baie par jour pour survivre. La diète fait partie de l’entraînement de ce Pokémon.",learn:[[1,"confusion"],[1,"work-up"],[9,"detect"],[12,"endure"],[15,"feint"],[17,"force-palm"],[20,"psybeam"],[23,"calm-mind"],[25,"zen-headbutt"],[28,"high-jump-kick"],[31,"psych-up"],[33,"acupressure"],[36,"power-trick"],[39,"reversal"],[41,"recover"],[44,"counter"]]},{id:308,name:"Charmina",key:"medicham",types:["fighting","psychic"],stats:{hp:60,atk:60,def:75,spa:60,spd:75,spe:80},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:31.5,genus:"Pokémon Méditation",flavor:"Grâce au pouvoir de la méditation, Charmina a développé son sixième sens. Il peut utiliser des pouvoirs télékinétiques. On sait que ce Pokémon peut méditer pendant un mois sans manger.",learn:[[12,"endure"],[15,"feint"],[17,"force-palm"],[20,"psybeam"],[23,"calm-mind"],[25,"zen-headbutt"],[28,"high-jump-kick"],[31,"psych-up"],[33,"acupressure"],[36,"power-trick"],[47,"recover"],[53,"counter"],[53,"axe-kick"]]},{id:309,name:"Dynavolt",key:"electrike",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:40,atk:45,def:40,spa:65,spd:40,spe:65},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:15.2,genus:"Pokémon Orage",flavor:"L’électricité statique s’accumule dans sa fourrure. Par temps sec, elle dégage des étincelles.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"thunder-wave"],[4,"leer"],[8,"howl"],[12,"quick-attack"],[16,"shock-wave"],[20,"bite"],[24,"thunder-fang"],[28,"roar"],[32,"discharge"],[36,"charge"],[40,"wild-charge"],[44,"thunder"]]},{id:310,name:"Élecsprint",key:"manectric",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:70,atk:75,def:60,spa:105,spd:60,spe:105},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:40.2,genus:"Pokémon Décharge",flavor:"Ce Pokémon évite de se montrer aux humains. On raconte qu’il fait son nid aux endroits où la foudre s’est abattue.",learn:[[12,"quick-attack"],[16,"shock-wave"],[20,"bite"],[24,"thunder-fang"],[30,"roar"],[36,"discharge"],[42,"charge"],[48,"wild-charge"],[54,"thunder"],[60,"electric-terrain"]]},{id:311,name:"Posipi",key:"plusle",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:60,atk:50,def:40,spa:85,spd:75,spe:95},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:4.2,genus:"Pokémon Acclameur",flavor:"Quand Posipi veut encourager son partenaire, des étincelles jaillissent un peu partout de son corps. Si son partenaire perd, ce Pokémon pleure à chaudes larmes.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"thunder-wave"],[1,"quick-attack"],[1,"play-nice"],[4,"helping-hand"],[7,"spark"],[10,"encore"],[13,"switcheroo"],[16,"swift"],[19,"electro-ball"],[22,"copycat"],[26,"charge"],[31,"discharge"],[34,"baton-pass"],[37,"agility"],[40,"last-resort"],[43,"thunder"],[46,"nasty-plot"],[49,"entrainment"]]},{id:312,name:"Négapi",key:"minun",types:["electric"],stats:{hp:60,atk:40,def:50,spa:75,spd:85,spe:95},captureRate:200,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:4.2,genus:"Pokémon Acclameur",flavor:"Négapi adore encourager son partenaire pendant les combats. Des étincelles jaillissent alors de son corps. Lorsque son partenaire est en difficulté, le corps de ce Pokémon libère encore plus d’étincelles.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"thunder-wave"],[1,"quick-attack"],[1,"play-nice"],[4,"helping-hand"],[7,"spark"],[10,"encore"],[13,"switcheroo"],[16,"swift"],[19,"electro-ball"],[22,"copycat"],[26,"charge"],[31,"discharge"],[34,"baton-pass"],[37,"agility"],[40,"last-resort"],[43,"thunder"],[46,"nasty-plot"],[49,"entrainment"]]},{id:313,name:"Muciole",key:"volbeat",types:["bug"],stats:{hp:65,atk:73,def:75,spa:47,spd:85,spe:85},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:17.7,genus:"Pokémon Luciole",flavor:"La queue de Muciole éclaire comme une ampoule. Ensemble, les Muciole dessinent des figures géométriques dans la nuit étoilée. Ce Pokémon adore le parfum dégagé par Lumivole.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[5,"double-team"],[8,"confuse-ray"],[12,"quick-attack"],[15,"struggle-bug"],[19,"moonlight"],[22,"tail-glow"],[26,"protect"],[29,"zen-headbutt"],[33,"helping-hand"],[36,"bug-buzz"],[40,"play-rough"],[43,"double-edge"],[47,"infestation"]]},{id:314,name:"Lumivole",key:"illumise",types:["bug"],stats:{hp:65,atk:47,def:75,spa:73,spd:85,spe:85},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:17.7,genus:"Pokémon Luciole",flavor:"Lumivole dirige un vol de Muciole lumineux pour dessiner des figures dans la nuit étoilée. On raconte que ce Pokémon gagne le respect de ses pairs en composant des figures complexes dans le ciel.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"play-nice"],[5,"sweet-scent"],[9,"charm"],[12,"quick-attack"],[15,"struggle-bug"],[19,"moonlight"],[22,"wish"],[26,"encore"],[29,"flatter"],[33,"zen-headbutt"],[36,"helping-hand"],[40,"bug-buzz"],[43,"play-rough"],[47,"infestation"]]},{id:315,name:"Rosélia",key:"roselia",types:["grass","poison"],stats:{hp:50,atk:60,def:45,spa:100,spd:80,spe:65},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.3,weight:2,genus:"Pokémon Épine",flavor:"Ses mains sécrètent chacune un poison différent dont il se sert pour attaquer. Plus le parfum de Rosélia est intense, plus sa santé est bonne.",learn:[[0,"poison-sting"],[1,"absorb"],[1,"growth"],[1,"stun-spore"],[1,"worry-seed"],[5,"mega-drain"],[10,"leech-seed"],[15,"magical-leaf"],[20,"toxic-spikes"],[25,"sweet-scent"],[30,"giga-drain"],[35,"synthesis"],[40,"toxic"],[45,"petal-blizzard"],[50,"aromatherapy"],[55,"ingrain"],[60,"petal-dance"]]},{id:316,name:"Gloupti",key:"gulpin",types:["poison"],stats:{hp:70,atk:43,def:53,spa:43,spd:53,spe:40},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:10.3,genus:"Pokémon Estomac",flavor:"Le corps de Gloupti n’est pratiquement qu’un gros estomac. En comparaison, son cœur et son cerveau sont tout petits. L’estomac de ce Pokémon contient des enzymes spéciales capables de tout dissoudre.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[5,"yawn"],[8,"poison-gas"],[10,"sludge"],[12,"amnesia"],[17,"acid-spray"],[20,"encore"],[25,"toxic"],[28,"stockpile"],[28,"spit-up"],[28,"swallow"],[33,"sludge-bomb"],[36,"gastro-acid"],[41,"belch"],[44,"pain-split"],[49,"gunk-shot"]]},{id:317,name:"Avaltout",key:"swalot",types:["poison"],stats:{hp:100,atk:73,def:83,spa:73,spd:83,spe:55},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.7,weight:80,genus:"Pokémon Sac Poison",flavor:"Avaltout n’a pas de dents, ce qui le force à tout avaler en une bouchée. Quand il bâille, sa bouche prend une taille impressionnante, et on pourrait y placer une roue de voiture.",learn:[[0,"body-slam"],[12,"amnesia"],[17,"acid-spray"],[20,"encore"],[25,"toxic"],[30,"stockpile"],[30,"spit-up"],[30,"swallow"],[37,"sludge-bomb"],[42,"gastro-acid"],[49,"belch"]]},{id:318,name:"Carvanha",key:"carvanha",types:["water","dark"],stats:{hp:45,atk:90,def:20,spa:65,spd:20,spe:65},captureRate:225,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:20.8,genus:"Pokémon Féroce",flavor:"Il possède une mâchoire puissante garnie de dents acérées. Les marins ne s’approchent jamais des eaux habitées par les Carvanha.",learn:[[1,"leer"],[1,"aqua-jet"],[4,"poison-fang"],[8,"focus-energy"],[12,"scary-face"],[16,"bite"],[20,"ice-fang"],[24,"screech"],[28,"swagger"],[32,"crunch"],[36,"agility"],[40,"liquidation"],[44,"take-down"]]},{id:319,name:"Sharpedo",key:"sharpedo",types:["water","dark"],stats:{hp:70,atk:120,def:40,spa:95,spd:40,spe:95},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:88.8,genus:"Pokémon Brutal",flavor:"Surnommé le « tyran des mers », ce Pokémon attaque sans exception tous les navires qui osent s’aventurer sur son territoire.",learn:[[0,"slash"],[12,"scary-face"],[16,"bite"],[20,"ice-fang"],[24,"screech"],[28,"swagger"],[34,"crunch"],[40,"agility"],[46,"liquidation"],[52,"take-down"]]},{id:320,name:"Wailmer",key:"wailmer",types:["water"],stats:{hp:130,atk:70,def:35,spa:70,spd:35,spe:60},captureRate:125,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:130,genus:"Pokémon Baleinboule",flavor:"Il ressemble à un énorme ballon quand il avale de très grandes quantités d’eau de mer. Il dévore une tonne de nourriture par jour.",learn:[[1,"splash"],[3,"growl"],[6,"astonish"],[12,"water-gun"],[15,"mist"],[18,"water-pulse"],[21,"heavy-slam"],[24,"brine"],[27,"whirlpool"],[30,"dive"],[33,"bounce"],[36,"body-slam"],[39,"rest"],[42,"amnesia"],[45,"hydro-pump"],[48,"water-spout"]]},{id:321,name:"Wailord",key:"wailord",types:["water"],stats:{hp:170,atk:90,def:45,spa:90,spd:45,spe:60},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:14.5,weight:398,genus:"Pokémon Cachabouée",flavor:"Sa taille fait de lui un Pokémon fascinant. Les sites touristiques proposant d’observer les Wailord ont toujours beaucoup de succès.",learn:[[15,"mist"],[18,"water-pulse"],[21,"heavy-slam"],[24,"brine"],[27,"whirlpool"],[30,"dive"],[33,"bounce"],[36,"body-slam"],[39,"rest"],[44,"amnesia"],[49,"hydro-pump"],[54,"water-spout"]]},{id:322,name:"Chamallot",key:"numel",types:["fire","ground"],stats:{hp:60,atk:60,def:40,spa:65,spd:45,spe:35},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:24,genus:"Pokémon Engourdi",flavor:"Chamallot stocke du magma à 1 200 °C dans son corps. Lorsqu’il est mouillé, le magma se refroidit et durcit. Le corps du Pokémon devient alors très lourd et ses mouvements très lents.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"growl"],[5,"ember"],[8,"focus-energy"],[12,"bulldoze"],[15,"incinerate"],[19,"amnesia"],[22,"lava-plume"],[26,"earth-power"],[29,"curse"],[31,"take-down"],[40,"earthquake"],[43,"flamethrower"],[47,"double-edge"]]},{id:323,name:"Camérupt",key:"camerupt",types:["fire","ground"],stats:{hp:70,atk:100,def:70,spa:105,spd:75,spe:40},captureRate:150,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.9,weight:220,genus:"Pokémon Éruption",flavor:"Les bosses sur le dos de Camérupt sont apparues après une déformation de ses os. Elles crachent parfois du magma en fusion. Ce Pokémon entre apparemment en éruption lorsqu’il est énervé.",learn:[[0,"rock-slide"],[12,"bulldoze"],[15,"incinerate"],[19,"amnesia"],[22,"lava-plume"],[26,"earth-power"],[29,"curse"],[31,"take-down"],[39,"yawn"],[46,"earthquake"]]},{id:324,name:"Chartor",key:"torkoal",types:["fire"],stats:{hp:70,atk:85,def:140,spa:85,spd:70,spe:20},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:80.4,genus:"Pokémon Charbon",flavor:"Les Chartor vivent en grand nombre dans les mines abandonnées, où ils extraient le charbon avec ardeur.",learn:[[1,"ember"],[1,"smog"],[4,"withdraw"],[8,"rapid-spin"],[12,"smokescreen"],[16,"clear-smog"],[20,"flame-wheel"],[24,"protect"],[28,"lava-plume"],[32,"body-slam"],[36,"iron-defense"],[40,"flamethrower"],[44,"curse"],[48,"heat-wave"],[52,"amnesia"],[56,"inferno"],[60,"shell-smash"],[64,"eruption"]]},{id:325,name:"Spoink",key:"spoink",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:60,atk:25,def:35,spa:70,spd:80,spe:60},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:30.6,genus:"Pokémon Rebond",flavor:"Spoink garde une perle sur sa tête. Elle lui sert à amplifier ses pouvoirs télékinétiques. Il est constamment en quête d’une perle plus grosse.",learn:[[1,"splash"],[7,"confusion"],[10,"growl"],[14,"psybeam"],[18,"psych-up"],[22,"confuse-ray"],[29,"rest"],[29,"power-gem"],[33,"snore"],[38,"psyshock"],[40,"payback"],[44,"psychic"],[50,"bounce"]]},{id:326,name:"Groret",key:"grumpig",types:["psychic"],stats:{hp:80,atk:45,def:65,spa:90,spd:110,spe:80},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:71.5,genus:"Pokémon Magouilleur",flavor:"Groret utilise les perles noires sur son corps pour exercer ses formidables pouvoirs. Quand il est en action, il entame une étrange danse. Les perles noires de ce Pokémon ont une valeur inestimable.",learn:[[0,"teeter-dance"],[18,"psych-up"],[22,"confuse-ray"],[26,"zen-headbutt"],[29,"power-gem"],[35,"rest"],[35,"snore"],[42,"psyshock"],[46,"payback"],[52,"psychic"],[60,"bounce"]]},{id:327,name:"Spinda",key:"spinda",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:60,atk:60,def:60,spa:60,spd:60,spe:60},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:5,genus:"Pokémon Panda Tache",flavor:"Chaque Spinda possède un pelage unique. Ce Pokémon esquive les attaques de son adversaire grâce à d’imprévisibles oscillations.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[5,"copycat"],[10,"teeter-dance"],[14,"psybeam"],[19,"hypnosis"],[23,"body-slam"],[28,"sucker-punch"],[37,"uproar"],[41,"psych-up"],[46,"double-edge"],[50,"flail"],[55,"thrash"]]},{id:328,name:"Kraknoix",key:"trapinch",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:45,atk:100,def:45,spa:45,spd:45,spe:10},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:15,genus:"Pokémon Piégeur",flavor:"Il creuse, puis attend ses proies dans son antre en forme de cône, dont il est impossible de s’échapper.",learn:[[1,"sand-attack"],[1,"astonish"],[8,"bite"],[12,"mud-slap"],[16,"sand-tomb"],[20,"bulldoze"],[24,"dig"],[28,"crunch"],[32,"sandstorm"],[36,"earth-power"],[40,"earthquake"],[44,"superpower"],[48,"fissure"]]},{id:329,name:"Vibraninf",key:"vibrava",types:["ground","dragon"],stats:{hp:50,atk:70,def:50,spa:50,spd:50,spe:70},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:15.3,genus:"Pokémon Vibration",flavor:"Pour aider ses ailes à pousser, il se nourrit chaque jour d’un grand nombre de proies qu’il dissout en projetant de l’acide.",learn:[[0,"dragon-breath"],[12,"mud-slap"],[16,"sand-tomb"],[20,"dragon-tail"],[24,"screech"],[28,"bug-buzz"],[32,"sandstorm"],[38,"earth-power"],[44,"earthquake"],[50,"uproar"],[56,"dragon-rush"],[62,"boomburst"]]},{id:330,name:"Libégon",key:"flygon",types:["ground","dragon"],stats:{hp:80,atk:100,def:80,spa:80,spd:80,spe:100},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:82,genus:"Pokémon Mystique",flavor:"On l’appelle « l’esprit du désert », car ses battements d’ailes résonnent comme une mélodie entonnée par une voix douce.",learn:[[0,"dragon-claw"],[12,"mud-slap"],[16,"sand-tomb"],[20,"dragon-tail"],[24,"screech"],[28,"bug-buzz"],[32,"sandstorm"],[38,"earth-power"],[44,"earthquake"],[52,"uproar"],[60,"dragon-rush"],[68,"boomburst"]]},{id:331,name:"Cacnea",key:"cacnea",types:["grass"],stats:{hp:50,atk:85,def:40,spa:85,spd:40,spe:35},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:51.3,genus:"Pokémon Cactus",flavor:"Si son environnement est aride et difficile, la fleur de Cacnea devient plus jolie et dégage un parfum délicat. Ce Pokémon se bat en agitant ses bras épineux.",learn:[[1,"poison-sting"],[1,"leer"],[4,"absorb"],[7,"growth"],[10,"leech-seed"],[13,"sand-attack"],[16,"bullet-seed"],[19,"power-trip"],[22,"ingrain"],[26,"payback"],[30,"spikes"],[34,"sucker-punch"],[38,"pin-missile"],[42,"energy-ball"],[46,"cotton-spore"],[50,"sandstorm"],[54,"destiny-bond"]]},{id:332,name:"Cacturne",key:"cacturne",types:["grass","dark"],stats:{hp:70,atk:115,def:60,spa:115,spd:60,spe:55},captureRate:60,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:77.4,genus:"Pokémon Épouvantail",flavor:"Lorsqu’un voyageur traverse le désert au milieu de la nuit, les Cacturne le suivent en groupe. Ces Pokémon attendent le bon moment, quand le voyageur est fatigué et qu’il n’est plus capable de bouger.",learn:[[0,"spiky-shield"],[10,"leech-seed"],[13,"sand-attack"],[16,"bullet-seed"],[19,"power-trip"],[22,"ingrain"],[26,"payback"],[30,"spikes"],[35,"sucker-punch"],[38,"pin-missile"],[44,"energy-ball"],[49,"cotton-spore"],[54,"sandstorm"]]},{id:333,name:"Tylton",key:"swablu",types:["normal","flying"],stats:{hp:45,atk:40,def:60,spa:40,spd:75,spe:50},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:1.2,genus:"Pokémon Oiseaucoton",flavor:"Ses ailes en forme de nuage le dissimulent aux yeux des ennemis. On raconte qu’elles sont devenues blanches après plusieurs générations.",learn:[[1,"growl"],[1,"peck"],[4,"disarming-voice"],[8,"mist"],[12,"fury-attack"],[16,"round"],[20,"dragon-breath"],[24,"safeguard"],[28,"sing"],[32,"cotton-guard"],[36,"take-down"],[40,"moonblast"],[44,"perish-song"]]},{id:334,name:"Altaria",key:"altaria",types:["dragon","flying"],stats:{hp:75,atk:70,def:90,spa:70,spd:105,spe:80},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:20.6,genus:"Pokémon Virevolteur",flavor:"Il est de nature aimable, mais si on le met en colère, il intimide son adversaire en poussant un cri strident et l’attaque sans pitié.",learn:[[0,"dragon-pulse"],[12,"fury-attack"],[16,"round"],[20,"dragon-breath"],[24,"safeguard"],[28,"sing"],[32,"cotton-guard"],[38,"take-down"],[44,"moonblast"],[50,"perish-song"],[56,"sky-attack"]]},{id:335,name:"Mangriff",key:"zangoose",types:["normal"],stats:{hp:73,atk:115,def:60,spa:60,spd:60,spe:90},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:40.3,genus:"Pokémon Chat Furet",flavor:"Mangriff est généralement à quatre pattes, mais lorsqu’il est en colère, il se lève sur ses pattes arrière et montre ses griffes. Ce Pokémon est l’ennemi juré de Séviper depuis plusieurs générations.",learn:[[1,"scratch"],[1,"leer"],[5,"quick-attack"],[8,"fury-cutter"],[12,"metal-claw"],[15,"hone-claws"],[19,"slash"],[22,"power-trip"],[26,"crush-claw"],[29,"false-swipe"],[33,"switcheroo"],[36,"detect"],[40,"x-scissor"],[43,"taunt"],[47,"swords-dance"],[50,"close-combat"]]},{id:336,name:"Séviper",key:"seviper",types:["poison"],stats:{hp:73,atk:100,def:60,spa:100,spd:60,spe:65},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:2.7,weight:52.5,genus:"Pokémon Serpacroc",flavor:"La queue tranchante comme un sabre de Séviper a deux fonctions : elle peut frapper l’ennemi et lui injecter un poison qu’il sécrète. Ce Pokémon n’oublie jamais sa vieille rancune envers Mangriff.",learn:[[1,"wrap"],[1,"swagger"],[4,"bite"],[6,"lick"],[9,"poison-tail"],[11,"feint"],[14,"screech"],[19,"glare"],[21,"poison-fang"],[24,"venoshock"],[29,"gastro-acid"],[31,"poison-jab"],[34,"haze"],[39,"crunch"],[41,"belch"],[44,"coil"],[46,"sludge-bomb"]]},{id:337,name:"Séléroc",key:"lunatone",types:["rock","psychic"],stats:{hp:90,atk:55,def:65,spa:95,spd:85,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:168,genus:"Pokémon Météorite",flavor:"Il a été découvert dans le cratère d’une météorite il y a 40 ans. Un simple regard de sa part endort ses ennemis.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"rock-throw"],[1,"confusion"],[1,"harden"],[1,"moonlight"],[1,"moonblast"],[5,"hypnosis"],[10,"rock-polish"],[15,"rock-slide"],[20,"psyshock"],[25,"cosmic-power"],[30,"psychic"],[35,"stone-edge"],[40,"future-sight"],[45,"magic-room"],[50,"explosion"]]},{id:338,name:"Solaroc",key:"solrock",types:["rock","psychic"],stats:{hp:90,atk:95,def:85,spa:55,spd:65,spe:70},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.2,weight:154,genus:"Pokémon Météorite",flavor:"Tirant sa force de l’énergie solaire, il est particulièrement puissant pendant la journée. Il s’illumine quand il tourne.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"rock-throw"],[1,"confusion"],[1,"harden"],[1,"morning-sun"],[1,"flare-blitz"],[5,"hypnosis"],[10,"rock-polish"],[15,"rock-slide"],[20,"zen-headbutt"],[25,"cosmic-power"],[30,"psychic"],[35,"stone-edge"],[40,"solar-beam"],[45,"wonder-room"],[50,"explosion"]]},{id:339,name:"Barloche",key:"barboach",types:["water","ground"],stats:{hp:50,atk:48,def:43,spa:46,spd:41,spe:60},captureRate:190,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:1.9,genus:"Pokémon Barbillon",flavor:"Il sonde les bords boueux des rivières avec ses barbillons. Un film fin et visqueux protège tout son corps.",learn:[[1,"water-gun"],[1,"mud-slap"],[6,"rest"],[6,"snore"],[12,"water-pulse"],[18,"amnesia"],[24,"aqua-tail"],[31,"muddy-water"],[36,"earthquake"],[42,"future-sight"],[48,"fissure"]]},{id:340,name:"Barbicha",key:"whiscash",types:["water","ground"],stats:{hp:110,atk:78,def:73,spa:76,spd:71,spe:60},captureRate:75,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.9,weight:23.6,genus:"Pokémon Barbillon",flavor:"Il a besoin d’un marais entier pour vivre. Si un ennemi s’approche, il s’énerve et déclenche un séisme.",learn:[[0,"thrash"],[12,"water-pulse"],[18,"amnesia"],[24,"aqua-tail"],[33,"muddy-water"],[40,"earthquake"],[48,"future-sight"],[56,"fissure"]]},{id:341,name:"Écrapince",key:"corphish",types:["water"],stats:{hp:43,atk:80,def:65,spa:50,spd:35,spe:35},captureRate:205,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:11.5,genus:"Pokémon Brute",flavor:"Un Pokémon importé, retourné à l’état sauvage. Il s’adapte même aux rivières les plus polluées.",learn:[[1,"water-gun"],[1,"harden"],[4,"leer"],[8,"taunt"],[12,"bubble-beam"],[16,"knock-off"],[20,"double-hit"],[24,"protect"],[28,"night-slash"],[32,"razor-shell"],[36,"swords-dance"],[40,"crunch"],[44,"crabhammer"],[48,"endeavor"],[52,"guillotine"]]},{id:342,name:"Colhomard",key:"crawdaunt",types:["water","dark"],stats:{hp:63,atk:120,def:85,spa:90,spd:55,spe:55},captureRate:155,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:32.8,genus:"Pokémon Crapule",flavor:"Il adore se battre et frappe comme une brute tous ceux qui approchent de sa mare.",learn:[[0,"swift"],[12,"bubble-beam"],[16,"knock-off"],[20,"double-hit"],[24,"protect"],[28,"night-slash"],[34,"razor-shell"],[40,"swords-dance"],[46,"crunch"],[52,"crabhammer"],[58,"endeavor"],[64,"guillotine"]]},{id:343,name:"Balbuto",key:"baltoy",types:["ground","psychic"],stats:{hp:40,atk:40,def:55,spa:40,spd:70,spe:55},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:21.5,genus:"Pokémon Poupargile",flavor:"Ce Pokémon découvert dans des ruines anciennes tourne sur lui-même pour se déplacer. Il se tient toujours sur un pied, même quand il dort.",learn:[[1,"harden"],[1,"mud-slap"],[3,"rapid-spin"],[6,"confusion"],[9,"rock-tomb"],[12,"power-trick"],[15,"psybeam"],[18,"ancient-power"],[21,"imprison"],[24,"cosmic-power"],[27,"extrasensory"],[30,"earth-power"],[33,"self-destruct"],[36,"guard-split"],[36,"power-split"],[39,"sandstorm"],[42,"explosion"]]},{id:344,name:"Kaorine",key:"claydol",types:["ground","psychic"],stats:{hp:60,atk:70,def:105,spa:70,spd:120,spe:75},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:108,genus:"Pokémon Poupargile",flavor:"Ce Pokémon aurait été créé à partir d’une poupée d’argile confectionnée par une ancienne civilisation. Il se déplace en lévitant.",learn:[[0,"hyper-beam"],[9,"rock-tomb"],[12,"power-trick"],[15,"psybeam"],[18,"ancient-power"],[21,"imprison"],[24,"cosmic-power"],[27,"extrasensory"],[30,"earth-power"],[33,"self-destruct"],[38,"guard-split"],[38,"power-split"],[43,"sandstorm"],[48,"explosion"]]},{id:345,name:"Lilia",key:"lileep",types:["rock","grass"],stats:{hp:66,atk:41,def:77,spa:61,spd:87,spe:23},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1,weight:23.8,genus:"Pokémon Lis d’Eau",flavor:"Accroché aux rochers des profondeurs, il attend qu’une proie s’approche de lui pour l’attraper avec ses tentacules en forme de pétales.",learn:[[1,"wrap"],[1,"astonish"],[4,"acid"],[8,"confuse-ray"],[12,"ingrain"],[16,"ancient-power"],[20,"mega-drain"],[24,"brine"],[28,"amnesia"],[32,"gastro-acid"],[36,"giga-drain"],[41,"stockpile"],[41,"spit-up"],[41,"swallow"],[44,"energy-ball"]]},{id:346,name:"Vacilys",key:"cradily",types:["rock","grass"],stats:{hp:86,atk:81,def:97,spa:81,spd:107,spe:43},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.5,weight:60.4,genus:"Pokémon Bernacle",flavor:"Il attrape ses proies à l’aide de ses tentacules, puis les dissout immédiatement avec ses sucs digestifs pour en absorber les nutriments.",learn:[[12,"ingrain"],[16,"ancient-power"],[20,"mega-drain"],[24,"brine"],[28,"amnesia"],[32,"gastro-acid"],[36,"giga-drain"],[43,"stockpile"],[43,"spit-up"],[43,"swallow"],[48,"energy-ball"]]},{id:347,name:"Anorith",key:"anorith",types:["rock","bug"],stats:{hp:45,atk:95,def:50,spa:40,spd:50,spe:75},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.7,weight:12.5,genus:"Pokémon Crustage",flavor:"Ce Pokémon peut nager très vite en agitant ses huit ailes comme des rames de bateau. Il fait partie des ancêtres des Pokémon Insecte.",learn:[[1,"harden"],[1,"fury-cutter"],[4,"w