bite"],[40,"ice-fang"],[47,"snowscape"],[54,"weather-ball"],[61,"crunch"],[68,"blizzard"]]},{id:363,name:"Obalie",key:"spheal",types:["ice","water"],stats:{hp:70,atk:40,def:50,spa:55,spd:50,spe:25},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.8,weight:39.5,genus:"Pokémon Clap Clap",flavor:"Il scrute la mer en se laissant porter par les vagues. Lorsqu’il repère des proies, il avertit les Kaimorse du groupe.",learn:[[1,"defense-curl"],[1,"rollout"],[4,"growl"],[8,"water-gun"],[12,"powder-snow"],[16,"rest"],[20,"snore"],[24,"brine"],[28,"aurora-beam"],[33,"encore"],[36,"body-slam"],[40,"surf"],[44,"blizzard"],[48,"hail"],[52,"sheer-cold"]]},{id:364,name:"Phogleur",key:"sealeo",types:["ice","water"],stats:{hp:90,atk:60,def:70,spa:75,spd:70,spe:45},captureRate:120,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.1,weight:87.6,genus:"Pokémon Roule Boule",flavor:"Il ne peut pas s’empêcher de faire tourner sur son museau tout ce qui a une forme sphérique, comme les Obalie ou les Poké Balls.",learn:[[0,"swagger"],[12,"powder-snow"],[16,"rest"],[20,"snore"],[24,"brine"],[28,"aurora-beam"],[35,"encore"],[40,"body-slam"],[46,"surf"],[52,"blizzard"],[58,"hail"],[64,"sheer-cold"]]},{id:365,name:"Kaimorse",key:"walrein",types:["ice","water"],stats:{hp:110,atk:80,def:90,spa:95,spd:90,spe:65},captureRate:45,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:150.6,genus:"Pokémon Brise Glace",flavor:"Ses défenses poussent tout au long de sa vie. Si l’une d’elles se brise au cours d’un combat, au bout d’un an, elle aura repoussé entièrement.",learn:[[12,"powder-snow"],[16,"rest"],[20,"snore"],[24,"brine"],[28,"aurora-beam"],[35,"encore"],[40,"body-slam"],[48,"surf"],[56,"blizzard"],[64,"hail"],[72,"sheer-cold"]]},{id:366,name:"Coquiperl",key:"clamperl",types:["water"],stats:{hp:35,atk:64,def:85,spa:74,spd:55,spe:32},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.4,weight:52.5,genus:"Pokémon Bivalve",flavor:"La perle de Coquiperl est tellement précieuse qu’elle peut valoir plus de dix fois la valeur de 