00,spe:50},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:1.8,weight:175,genus:"Pokémon Iceberg",flavor:"Ce Pokémon de l’ère glaciaire dont le corps est entièrement composé d’eau gelée serait né sous une épaisse couche de glace.",learn:[[1,"icy-wind"],[1,"charge-beam"],[6,"bulldoze"],[12,"ancient-power"],[18,"stomp"],[24,"ice-beam"],[30,"curse"],[36,"amnesia"],[42,"hammer-arm"],[48,"blizzard"],[54,"superpower"],[60,"lock-on"],[66,"zap-cannon"],[72,"hyper-beam"],[78,"explosion"]]},{id:379,name:"Registeel",key:"registeel",types:["steel"],stats:{hp:80,atk:75,def:150,spa:75,spd:150,spe:50},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:1.9,weight:205,genus:"Pokémon Fer",flavor:"Il paraît qu’il est né dans le manteau terrestre et qu’il en a émergé il y a environ 10 000 ans.",learn:[[1,"metal-claw"],[1,"charge-beam"],[6,"bulldoze"],[12,"ancient-power"],[18,"stomp"],[24,"flash-cannon"],[24,"iron-head"],[30,"curse"],[36,"amnesia"],[36,"iron-defense"],[42,"hammer-arm"],[48,"heavy-slam"],[54,"superpower"],[60,"lock-on"],[66,"zap-cannon"],[72,"hyper-beam"],[78,"explosion"]]},{id:380,name:"Latias",key:"latias",types:["dragon","psychic"],stats:{hp:80,atk:80,def:90,spa:110,spd:130,spe:110},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:1.4,weight:40,genus:"Pokémon Éon",flavor:"Latias est très intelligent et comprend le langage des hommes. Il est recouvert d’une espèce de duvet ressemblant à du verre. Ce Pokémon s’enveloppe dans ce duvet et reflète la lumière pour changer son apparence.",learn:[[1,"charm"],[1,"stored-power"],[5,"helping-hand"],[10,"recover"],[15,"confusion"],[20,"tailwind"],[25,"dragon-breath"],[30,"wish"],[35,"mist-ball"],[40,"zen-headbutt"],[45,"dragon-pulse"],[50,"heal-pulse"],[55,"reflect-type"],[60,"psychic"],[65,"guard-split"],[70,"healing-wish"]]},{id:381,name:"Latios",key:"latios",types:["dragon","psychic"],stats:{hp:80,atk:90,def:80,spa:130,spd:110,spe:110},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:2,weight:60,genus:"Pokémon Éon",flavor:"Latios n’ouvrira son cœur qu’à un Dresseur doté d’un esprit compatissant. Ce Pokémon peut voler plus vite qu’un avion à réaction en repliant ses pattes avant pour améliorer son aérodynamisme.",learn:[[1,"dragon-dance"],[1,"stored-power"],[5,"helping-hand"],[10,"recover"],[15,"confusion"],[20,"tailwind"],[25,"dragon-breath"],[30,"ally-switch"],[35,"luster-purge"],[40,"zen-headbutt"],[45,"dragon-pulse"],[50,"heal-pulse"],[55,"simple-beam"],[60,"psychic"],[65,"power-split"],[70,"memento"]]},{id:382,name:"Kyogre",key:"kyogre",types:["water"],stats:{hp:100,atk:100,def:90,spa:150,spd:140,spe:90},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:4.5,weight:352,genus:"Pokémon Bassinmarin",flavor:"Un Pokémon considéré comme l’avatar des océans. Selon les légendes, il a disputé de nombreux combats avec Groudon pour contrôler l’énergie de la nature.",learn:[[1,"body-slam"],[1,"scary-face"],[1,"ancient-power"],[1,"water-pulse"],[1,"origin-pulse"],[9,"aqua-tail"],[18,"calm-mind"],[27,"muddy-water"],[36,"ice-beam"],[45,"sheer-cold"],[54,"aqua-ring"],[72,"hydro-pump"],[81,"double-edge"],[90,"water-spout"]]},{id:383,name:"Groudon",key:"groudon",types:["ground"],stats:{hp:100,atk:150,def:140,spa:100,spd:90,spe:90},captureRate:3,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:3.5,weight:950,genus:"Pokémon Continent",flavor:"Grâce à l’énergie de la nature, il peut accomplir sa Primo-Résurgence pour retrouver son apparence originelle. Ce pouvoir lui permet de créer du magma pour étendre les continents.",learn:[[1,"scary-face"],[1,"ancient-power"],[1,"mud-shot"],[1,"lava-plume"],[1,"precipice-blades"],[9,"earth-power"],[18,"bulk-up"],[27,"earthquake"],[36,"hammer-arm"],[45,"fissure"],[54,"rest"],[72,"fire-blast"],[81,"solar-beam"],[90,"eruption"]]},{id:384,name:"Rayquaza",key:"rayquaza",types:["dragon","flying"],stats:{hp:105,atk:150,def:90,spa:150,spd:90,spe:95},captureRate:45,legendary:!0,mythical:!1,height:7,weight:206.5,genus:"Pokémon Cieux",flavor:"Un Pokémon qui vit dans la couche d’ozone et se nourrit des météorite