ler et à refléter la vérité quand on le polit, mais il a horreur de cela.",learn:[[1,"tackle"],[1,"confusion"],[4,"confuse-ray"],[8,"payback"],[12,"imprison"],[16,"gyro-ball"],[20,"hypnosis"],[24,"safeguard"],[28,"extrasensory"],[32,"heavy-slam"],[36,"iron-defense"],[40,"metal-sound"],[44,"future-sight"]]},{id:437,name:"Archéodong",key:"bronzong",types:["steel","psychic"],stats:{hp:67,atk:89,def:116,spa:79,spd:116,spe:33},captureRate:90,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:1.3,weight:187,genus:"Pokémon Clochebronze",flavor:"De nombreux savants pensent que ce Pokémon n’est pas originaire de Galar à cause des motifs qui ornent son corps.",learn:[[0,"block"],[12,"imprison"],[16,"gyro-ball"],[20,"hypnosis"],[24,"safeguard"],[28,"extrasensory"],[32,"heavy-slam"],[38,"iron-defense"],[44,"metal-sound"],[50,"future-sight"],[56,"rain-dance"]]},{id:438,name:"Manzaï",key:"bonsly",types:["rock"],stats:{hp:50,atk:80,def:95,spa:10,spd:45,spe:10},captureRate:255,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.5,weight:15,genus:"Pokémon Bonsaï",flavor:"Il vit dans les zones rocheuses arides. Quand ses boules vertes sont sèches, elles se mettent à briller légèrement.",learn:[[1,"fake-tears"],[1,"copycat"],[4,"flail"],[8,"rock-throw"],[12,"block"],[16,"mimic"],[20,"rock-tomb"],[24,"tearful-look"],[28,"sucker-punch"],[32,"rock-slide"],[36,"low-kick"],[40,"counter"],[44,"double-edge"]],baby:!0},{id:439,name:"Mime Jr.",key:"mime-jr",types:["psychic","fairy"],stats:{hp:20,atk:25,def:45,spa:70,spd:90,spe:60},captureRate:145,legendary:!1,mythical:!1,height:.6,weight:13,genus:"Pokémon Mime",flavor:"Il considère les meilleurs danseurs parmi les M. Glaquette comme ses maîtres et s’évertue à mimer leurs mouvements.",learn:[[1,"pound"],[1,"copycat"],[4,"baton-pass"],[8,"encore"],[12,"confusion"],[16,"role-play"],[20,"protect"],[24,"recycle"],[28,"psybeam"],[32,"mimic"],[36,"light-screen"],[36,"reflect"],[36,"safeguard"],[40,"sucker-punch"],[44,"dazzling-gleam"],[48,"psychic"],[52,"teeter-dance"]],baby:!0},{id:440,